   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="Number">32998</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">.NET Application Development</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Develop a Visual Studio console application in C# that makes use of command line arguments. Once completed, the entire Visual Studio project will be submitted via UTSOnline. The assignment will then be formally demonstrated in the students assigned laboratory the week after the due date. A complete description of the assignment will be given on the release date.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Programming Assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exercises</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Between 200 and 300 lines of code.The exact number will depend on how the students solves the task.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 8              Online Submission: Monday 21st September 2020 by 11.59 pm  Demonstration: During labs of Week 8.  Code to be uploaded to UTS Online by midnight (11.59 pm) on the due date.  Functionality to be demonstrated in labs.See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Online Submission: Monday 21st September 2020 by 11.59 pm  Demonstration: During labs of Week 8.  Code to be uploaded to UTS Online by midnight (11.59 pm) on the due date.  Functionality to be demonstrated in labs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Develop a Visual Studio Windows form application in C#. Once completed, the entire Visual Studio project will be submitted via UTS Online. The assignment will then be formally demonstrated in the students assigned laboratory the week after the due date. A complete description of the assignment will be given on the release date.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Programming Assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exercises</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">300 to 400 lines of code. The number of lines will depend on the solution the student develops for the assignment.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12              Online Submission: Monday 19th October 2020, by 11.59 pm.  Demonstrations: During labs of Week 12  Assessment code to be uploaded to UTS Online by midnight (11.59 pm) on the due date. Functionality to be demonstrated in labs.See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Online Submission: Monday 19th October 2020, by 11.59 pm.  Demonstrations: During labs of Week 12  Assessment code to be uploaded to UTS Online by midnight (11.59 pm) on the due date. Functionality to be demonstrated in labs.</Data></Cell>
