    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The intent of the research topic is to allow students to develop a deeper understanding of some emerging aspects of the subject material. Telecommunication engineers typically perform research on new technologies and compare them with existing systems.</Data></Cell>
