   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32113</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advanced Database</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This task requires you to design an Star Schema of your design of a Data Warehouse, and provide written explanation of your design. You also have to write SQL queries to retrieve data.This is not a group assignment. It is an individual assignment.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Design Assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Design/drawing/plan/sketch</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30/08/2019</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">05:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5.00pm Friday 30 August 2019              Submission at UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Submission at UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To do a design assignment to develop a Data warehouse.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This task requires you to present a topic, which is related to Design/Implementation/Case-Study of Data Warehousing technology. You will be presenting your research on how Data Warehousing technology is currently used in the industry. Time duration for each presentation will be around 20 Minutes, with 5 minutes for questions. A detailed typed report of your research should be presented before the actual group presentation. The typed report should consist of 3500 words, approximately. Note: Presentations and lab will be running concurrently (at the same time in different rooms).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group presentation/report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Demonstration</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20/09/2019</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">05:00 PM</Data></Cell>
