    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">dd/mm/yyyy, time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The project requires students to achieve final solutions to civil engineering problems whilst developing models and solving technical problems. In those projects, the students will be asked to model a comprehensive structural problem. Cases will be relevant to industry problems.</Data></Cell>
