    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Validation of students' knowledge.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The final exam is a 2-hour open-book exam covering lectures, tutorials, labs and online presentations. University-approved calculators are allowed. The examination tests analytical and critical thinking and general understanding of the course material in a controlled fashion. Questions may be drawn from any aspect of the course. Marks will be assigned according to the correctness of the responses.</Data></Cell>
