   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32601</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advanced Project Management</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Review an authentic (completed) industry project and analyse, critique and report on its operation and learning outcomes. This task is to be done in groups of 4 to 5 people. Work-based projects are acceptable for selection if already completed or near completion. This is a group submission (modified by individual peer assessment) comprised of a report document with accompanying video presentation highlighting key messages.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Executive-level Project Critique Report with Video Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3,500 to 4,500 words for the report body (i.e. excluding title page, exec summary, table of contents, appendices, etc.). Video presentation of 10 to 15 minutes (PowerPoint with voiceover narration is acceptable).</Data></Cell>
