    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is a literature review and research report. Each student is required to develop a research question within a topic selected from a list that will be provided. Students will need to adopt and support a specific point of view in regard to their chosen topic and produce a well-researched and reasoned discussion to argue their position.</Data></Cell>
