   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49274</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advanced Robotics</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For this task, the students need to understand the basic concept and algorithm of Bayesian filter and particle filter, then complete the C++ code for implementing the particle filter. The structure and part of the code is provided. The student needs to complete the code, evaluate and test its performance, then submit the code to the tutor. See the assignment document on UTSOnline for more details.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Localization of a mobile robot using particle filter</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12/08/2019</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">06:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6.00pm Monday 12 August 2019              Week 4</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 4</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For this task, the students need to understand the Astar path planning algorithm, then complete the C++ code for implementing the particle filter. The structure and part of the code is provided. The student needs to complete the code, evaluate and test its performance, then submit the code to the tutor. See the assignment document on UTSOnline for more details.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Plan a path for a mobile robot</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">02/09/2019</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">06:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6.00pm Monday 2 September 2019              Week 7</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 7</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For this group task, each group of students will need to complete the implementation of the algorithm for the group project they are allocated, and demonstrate to the supervisor the effectiveness of the algorithm for fulfill the project requirements. See the project document on UTSOnline for more details.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project Demonstration</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
