    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For this group task, each group of students will need to write a report detailing the project requirements, the methodology adopted, the algorithms implemented, and the final results they achieved. See the project document on UTSOnline for more details.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project Documentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
