    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is a restricted open book exam assessing the students' understanding of the different methodologies and algorithms for mobile robot localization, mapping, and navigation. See the sample exam questions on UTSOnline for more details.Students are allowed to bring 10 A4 pages handwritten notes and any calculators to the exam.</Data></Cell>
