   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32009</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advanced Routing Principles</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The chapter on-line tests will be completed through Cisco Academy on-line exam server in each week outside of the class hours.Students are expected to do these to assist their learning of this subject. The feedback of results will be immediate and automatic, with guidance as to which subject areas the student needs to study further. Online tests completed after the due date will not be marked.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Weekly Chapter Online tests</Data></Cell>
