    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multiple on-line chapter tests are completed progressively through the semester. The progressive tasks and checking date/time are due by the beginning of lectures on Week 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multiple on-line chapter tests are completed progressively through the semester. The progressive tasks and checking date/time are due by the beginning of lectures on Week 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11</Data></Cell>
