    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment provides students with an opportunity for self-reflection, self-preview and self-review.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment is composed of certain number of short answer questions. The key points focus on the essential topics between week 1 and week 6. This quiz is to evaluate the students’ understanding of the key concepts of the related chapters. This is a closed book quiz.</Data></Cell>
