    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This early session assessment is designed to give students feedback in terms of what they learn by the middle of semester so that students can adjust their learning strategy and improve their learning efficiency.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Skills Based Assessment will provide the opportunity for students to demonstrate their network design, installation, deployment, and troubleshooting skills using advanced routing technologies. Except the personal learning journal and lab manual, no other materials are allowed during the exam. This is a group based assessment. It is suggested to form a group of 3 students from the 1st week of the session so the group is able to work together through the session for all activities including skills based assessments. The final group for the skills based assessment will be confirmed a week before the assessment.</Data></Cell>
