    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To validate learning on the fundamental concepts, problem solving skills, analysis and design procedures for foundations and geotechnical structures in real life. To assess student's abilities to develop the required objectives of the subject and gain sound knowledge of modern soil mechanics and foundation design. To encourage students to review the main concepts of the topics and integrate the knowledge gained throughout the session.</Data></Cell>
