   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42010</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advanced and Distributed Operating Systems</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Written assignment on use of virtualisation technologies in Advanced and Distributed Operating Systems.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual Assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This project is divided into the following deliverables (1) A project specification, learning contract and assessment criteria will be negotiated with the subject coordinator and their tutor by week 3. (2) A design and architecture report for viable Advanced and Distributed and Distributed Operating Systems infrastructure (using Open Source or commercial product) will be delivered by week 8. (3) Implement/Build this infrastructure stack, noting issues of this deployment by week 11. (4) A presentation on the implementation will be during the lecture in week 11. This includes peer marking and critical review.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Major Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The scale and scope of the implementation will be negotiated on the basis of the size of the group.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will negotiate a learning contract which will include the project assessment criteria.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">An individual student (or possible a small group 2-3 of students) will complete a Project and deliver a solution that involves: specification, architecture, design, development and implementation of a major Advanced and Distributed Operating Systems technology based application.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This exam will cover a broad theory behind Advanced and Distributed Operating Systems. This may include interprocess communication, kernel design, selection of technologies and their characteristics , types of dynamic scheduling security issues, virtualisation, threading, or what to look for in a typical distributed operating systems , etc.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Theory Exam</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
