    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Online Submission: Monday 19th October 2020, by 11.59 pm. Demonstrations: During the Labs of Week 12.   Code to be uploaded to UTS Online by midnight (11.59 pm) on the due date.  Functionality to be demonstrated in labs.</Data></Cell>
