    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students demonstrate their ability to deliver a Product or Prototype to an agreed scope. In doing so, students also demonstrate their capacity to solve problems, create solutions, work in teams, communicate professionally, and manage time and tasks.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Each student creates a Personal Design Journal and record their experiences and reflections on a regular basis. The students may use whatever tool or medium they choose to record their journal. If they do not use the Journals in UTSOnline, they must at least copy their entries to that Journal for assessment.</Data></Cell>
