    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Creation of a Personal Design Journal that allows each student to record and reflect on their process and experiences in completing both their Individual Learning Contracts as well as their participation in the Team Product.</Data></Cell>
