    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students are encouraged to do these to assist their learning of this subject. The feedback of results will be immediate and automatic, with guidance as to which subject areas the student needs to study further. The mark of this assessment is only based on the students' attendance on these on-line tests by the due date. Students' actual scores provided by the online system will not affect the mark contributed in the subject.</Data></Cell>
