    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Skills Based Assessments (SBAs) are designed for students to demonstrate their understanding of secure router and ASA configurations. This assessment will be designed as a senario where the secure network requires a VPN link to a Branch office through the company's firewall. Students will need to demonstrate this as a working model. Skills assessed will include cabling and configuration using both CLI and CCP. This assessment is done in small groups of 2~3 person per group. The contribution of each individual in a group will be monitored throughout the session. Should the need arise, the mark allocated for individuals within groups can reflect an agreed level of contribution by members of the group.</Data></Cell>
