   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42049</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Architecting on Amazon Web Services</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be presented with a few Multiple Choice Questions (MCQ). These MCQs are derived based on the lecture content the previous week. The quizzes are developed and administered by AWS. The quizzes are meant to provide students feedback on their learning. Students will be required to secure 50% marks to pass the quiz components alone. If the students secure less than 50% marks in any given quiz, then the corresponding quiz mark would be 0. Multiple attempts are not allowed.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Administered in the lab. Students will be required to completed about 5-6 MCQs at the beginning of each lab. Once the MCQs have been answered they can start their lab activities.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
