    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz – Assess students' understanding of lecture content</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will work in groups to solve the presented business problem. In this project the students will be required to identify which AWS services and how they can be integrated with each other to address the problem. The specification of the business problem is developed and provided by AWS.</Data></Cell>
