    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will work in groups to solve the presented business problem. In this project the students will be required to identify which AWS services and how they can be integrated with each other to address the problem. They will also be required to build the services in the AWS console. The specification of the business problem is developed and provided by AWS.</Data></Cell>
