    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bioinformatics</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group assignment with individual assessment. This assignment is an oral presentation where students research a given topic in genomics and present an overview in relation to health, biotechnology, and bioinformatics.</Data></Cell>
