    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Provides specific case study of “design for user” in medical device technology. Understanding design for the user, and how it may be considered within new medical technology developments.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">What is required  What is the problem you are solving? 5 marks Overview of your product / technology 4 marks Overview of the design/development process you will undertake 3 marks Overview of regulatory process – which territories, agencies, types of submissions, key information required for submissions 3 marks Overview of key risks of the device and how you plan to overcome them 3 marks What are the key usability considerations for the product? 4 marks Any gaps or outstanding considerations you still need to address 3 marks  Presentation Provide all of this information in a presentation to the class. The whole group must contribute in some way (not everyone needs to speak). Powerpoint / props / other presentation material are allowed and encouraged.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
