    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Promote students' critical thinking towards the subject content and cutting-edge research. Assessing the student's ability to critically appraise published research findings and applying what they have learnt in class in creating a solution to a biomedical polymer application. Students will be assessed based on the solution they have provided and will be assessed not only on the functionality of the solution but also the human centric design of the solution.</Data></Cell>
