    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42906</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Biomedical Signal Processing</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Design of filters for ECG signal processing: a. Design an analogue filter for an ECG signal generator. b. Design a digital filter by using Matlab and implement in Labview environment.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lab Project 1: Evaluation of filter design for ECG signal processing</Data></Cell>
