    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Demonstration of individual ability of analogue/digital Filter design for TA or ECG signals processing.  Demonstration of ability to critically analyse the performance of the designed filters.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lab Project 2: Signal processing for non-stationary signals in Labview environment.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lab Project 2: Signal processing for non-stationary signals in Labview environment</Data></Cell>
