    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Demonstration of individual ability of design standalone systems (by using microcontroller) for the implementation of real-time signal/image processing. Demonstration of individual ability of design and implementation of signal classification algorithms. Demonstration of the ability of analysis of real time system performance of signal/image processing. Demonstration of the ability to communicate effectively with peers and general audiences.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the lab.</Data></Cell>
