   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32558</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Business Intelligence</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Choose an organisation or industry and explore existing usage of BI. Provide data and evidence to support arguments. Investigate how BI is helping the organisation / industry.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 1 - BI Analysis</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Between 1000 and 1500 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 4</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Become familiar with business intelligence capabilities in order to understand how they benefit the organisation or industry.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Using the concepts of BI, find out what other data and information can be integrated to create insights. Discuss technologies that help to create insights and support decisions. Discover useful patterns that can help the organisation / industry.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 2 - BI Implementation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28/08/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59pm Friday 28 August 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Gain a deeper understanding of management and implementation concepts of business intelligence.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assignment is done in a group of 3 students on selected projects dealing with current issues in Business Intelligence (BI). The output of this project will be a report which contains some research, analysis, and design.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 3 - BI Solution</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approximately 6000 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Infograph: 11.59 pm Friday 25 September 2020 Report: 11.59 pm Friday 9 October 2020 Presentation: In-class Week 11/12</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Develop a business intelligence (BI) solution for a real-case scenario, applying knowledge obtained through the subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Infograph: 11.59 pm Friday 25 September 2020 Report: 11.59 pm Friday 9 October 2020 Presentation: In-class Week 11/12</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Class discussion (10%): Students are expected to participate in class debates/discussions for given topics on a weekly basis. Students may refer to lectures, books, journals, websites or personal experiences in the given topics. Students are to back up their contributions with arguments and evidence with relevant references, links, etc. Discussion topics will be provided in lectures. You should use coherent arguments bearing in mind the advice given in lectures and on this site for making professional and ethical arguments. Blog (10%): A blog on a BI-related topic to be posted to Canvas. Students will be giving feedback to multiple blogs by suggesting or asking questions. This will be assessed on the merit of understanding, feedback, reflection, and appropriate probing questions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Class discussion and reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Blog: 11.59 pm Friday 2 October 2020 feedback and comments on multiple blogs: 11.59 pm Friday 16 October 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Blog: 11.59 pm Friday 2 October 2020 feedback and comments on multiple blogs: 11.59 pm Friday 16 October 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop critical discussion and reflection skills to communicate understanding and seek inquiry on given topics. This assessment task is intended to allow students to critically engage with the material covered in this subject throughout the session. Through pre-reading and collaborative discussions in class meetings or online blogs through Canvas, students formulate their responses to questions designed to encourage reflective learning.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
