    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The research project done in a group of 3 students on a selected topic dealing with current issues in decision support technology and business intelligence. The output of this project will be a report which contains some research, design and development on one of these technologies: decision models, decision methods, decision support systems, applications of decision technology in the area of business intelligence, approximately 10,000 to 12,000 words. Students are encouraged to develop a prototype of decision support systems and business intelligence for implementing the learnt methods and models.</Data></Cell>
