   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32559</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Business Systems Design</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The group will be required to analyze a complex business environment to identify problems to be solved in that environment. The focus will be on business agility and ways to improve response to canges in the business environment. It will work as a collaborative group to identify problems that address stakeholder needs. The group will use tools from design thinking, which is now increasingly used in business environments to identify the problems common to the stakeholders . These first identify the major themes in the solution of complex problems. These themes identify detailed projects, that will be part of assignment 2.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case Study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59pm Monday 27 April 2020              The assignment will be submitted online. Further details will be provided in class.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The assignment will be submitted online. Further details will be provided in class.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Use communication skills to work as a tream to discuss and Identify the potenital issues to be addressed and the problems to be solved.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual students will address themes defined in assignment 1. They will continue with a theme and select any one the issues to be addressed in the theme. They will then identify the joint value propositions for selected stakeholders and develop a way to meet them. In doing so they will need to propose innovative ways to realize ideas in the the joint way proposition and develop a business model that will be the innovation into practice.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15/06/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59pm Monday 15 June 2020              The assignment will be submitted online. Further details will be provided in class.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The assignment will be submitted online. Further details will be provided in class.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Your goal is to define information system requirements in a complex environment such as a smart citry, supply chain, health system and show how it will addd value to the system stakeholders. In this you will have to identify the stakeholder vision, business system missions and projects. You will then have to select one project using criteria of knowledge sharing, social networking and process workflow for development in assignment 2.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Working as a team, develop and propose business solutions to problems identified in Assessment Task 1: Case Study.</Data></Cell>
