   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41001</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Cloud Computing and Software as a Service</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A list of cloud-computing topics will be given by the lecturer. Each group needs to select one topic, conduct research on it and write an essay based on their findings. The group is expected to read at least 5 references relevant to the topic prior to writing the report. The suggested structure of the report will be discussed during the lecture.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Research Essay</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Essay</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approximately five (5) A4 pages.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">06:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6.00pm Monday 27 April 2020See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
