    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A case study pertaining to SaaS development will be given to the students. Students will work in groups of three each to engineer a prototype SaaS using the Force.com platform.</Data></Cell>
