    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This task is based on the Cloud-based software development skills that are covered in the lectures and the labs.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students (working in groups three each) are expected to write a project report (the key descriptors of which will be discussed during the lecture) on the SaaS development exercise carried out as a part of Assessment Item 2.</Data></Cell>
