   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42081</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Complex Data Analysis and Design</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students use data analytical awareness to define the problem suitable for industrial context. This is a scenario-based task where students have to (i) define a meaningful problem from the given company database, (ii) provide an analysis plan; and (iii) propose recommendations. Student deliverables will include a report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
