    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.00pm Monday 31 August 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment will evaluate student learning towards the design, data collection and application of a data analytical model, providing appropriate managerial recommendations.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students use understanding gained in this subject to respond to a set of questions in online quiz format. It will be a two-hour online test where responses are required to various situations with short written answers including multiple-choice questions. It is open book and students will need a non-programmable calculator.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mid-term test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
