    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment will evaluate general understanding about the complex data analytics and optimisation techniques and situations where these could be applicable.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students use the learning from the lectures and information gained from research into the topic and address the challenges of an organisation in the case study. This task requires students to form into a group/team to collaborate and effectively design and solve the organisational problem and prepare a report and presentation showing degree to which they have addressed the case study challenges.</Data></Cell>
