   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48340</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Construction</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The student must choose one or more sites where construction or building activities are being undertaken and critically observe and report on 04 activities. Every student must complete at least one peer review of another student's assignment. Students are responsible for arranging for their own notebook parts to be peer reviewed by a class colleague and for the inclusion of that colleague’s signed peer review report being attached to their submission directly beneath the cover sheet.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Notebook</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Between 3000 and 4000 words plus appropriate photographs and/or diagrams.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17 April 2020 before 11:59 pm (midnight). Students must submit what they have completed by the deadline (please see Assessment: faculty procedures and advice for further details).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17 April 2020 before 11:59 pm (midnight). Students must submit what they have completed by the deadline (please see Assessment: faculty procedures and advice for further details).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You will be assigned to a group in Week 5 of the session, attendance at this week's &quot;Lecture&quot; class is compulsory. Students may not select their own group members. The group is to assume it has been formed to contribute to a company's tender process by planning and preparing a network and report for a project. The Team Planning assignment brief is provided in the supplementary instructions and includes detailed information, requirements, assessment criteria and advice. This assessment task requires students to undertake extensive collaboration with their group colleagues.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Team Planning Assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">It is very important that each item mentioned in the assignment brief is addessed in the group's report. Do not attach the brief or the set of drawings to your report - the client has that documentation.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22 May 2020 before 11:59 pm (midnight).  The group must submit what has been completed by the deadline (please see Assessment: faculty procedures and advice for further details).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22 May 2020 before 11:59 pm (midnight).  The group must submit what has been completed by the deadline (please see Assessment: faculty procedures and advice for further details).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This subject has a centrally conducted Formal Examination, which will be held after end of the teaching period. All students must attend the exam at UTS. The duration of the examination is 2 hours. It is open book, non-programmable calculators may be used. Past examination papers are not available.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Exam</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period</Data></Cell>
