    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students are encouraged to undertake the quizzes progressively throughout the semester. Multiple attempts may be undertaken. The student's progressive points for each quiz and running total for this assessment task is shown in the Gradebook. The total mark (out of 5) achieved by students for the quizzes will be determined on the morning of the final exam.See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
