    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To allow students to demonstrate their knowledge of the concepts learnt in the subject, apply their skills to solve problems and self-assess their progress in the subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In groups of 3, students write a report on a materials design project. You will be provided with a real-world design problem and as a materials engineer for the project, you are required to produce a report that specifies concrete mix design and material specifications. Decisions are to be justified and substantiated through references to literature (online databases, textbooks, jounrals, Standards etc.) See UTSOnline for further details</Data></Cell>
