    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Whilst solving a design scenario/problem, using concrete or steel as the construction material, students are expected to demonstrate their subject knowledge, problem solving and research skills.</Data></Cell>
