    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Submit through the Task 5 dropbox in UTSOnline</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This task will be assessed holistically. Examination of exemplars forms an in-class activity.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Professional engineers need to be able to reflect upon their experiences and identify what they have learnt. This task uses a reflective framework from Engineers Australia Stage 1 competencies which addresses the major competencies required for applying established engineering methods to complex engineering problem solving.</Data></Cell>
