    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 2 to Week 10              Reflection on ‘top five’ moments due on Thursday 21 May 2020 11.59pm in Turnitin via UTSonline + Weekly progress and participation in class week 2-10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection on ‘top five’ moments due on Thursday 21 May 2020 11.59pm in Turnitin via UTSonline + Weekly progress and participation in class week 2-10</Data></Cell>
