    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ability to deliver an individual video pitch on an early solution (background, design, implementation, results and conclusions) with both effective and clear communication skills.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Written report on the design of a solution in 2 parts: one on the early solution, and one on the final solution. The documents will need to highlight evidence of individual effort within the group.</Data></Cell>
