    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purpose of this task is to demonstration the ability of the team and individual to design an innovative solution to an agreed scope. In doing so, students also demonstrate their capacity to solve problems, create solutions, work in teams, communicate professionally, and manage time and tasks.</Data></Cell>
