    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Choose a public dataset/Kaggle competition/custom dataset from the examples provided, or find your own. Download the data, explore it, and clean it.  Design and implement a data analysis process, incorporating appropriate visualisation and statistical testing. Write a short report on the implementation, linking the concepts and method learned in the class.</Data></Cell>
