   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42046</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Data Processing Using R</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Maintain and complete an interactive learning journal as you approach seven out of a variety of set problems set during the interactive sessions. Develop comprehensive responses focusing not only on technically solving the data analysis problem but also on commenting on the language features, packages, and novel approaches used to do so.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Interactive Learning Journal</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Journal</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approximately 4-6 pages per problem, for a total of 28-42 pages. The submission should be the output of a RMarkdown file, submitted with the code chunks included.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To ensure that the student has a firm understanding of R programming basics. This will facilitate the learning of advanced topics.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Choose a problem from the provided list of business analytics tasks. Design and implement a novel solution, defining appropriate questions and metrics, and incorporating data acquisition pipelines, interactive visualisation and appropriate analytics to answer the provided questions. Write a short online, interactive report to describe the outcome and provide the solution in a form appropriate for a wide audience. Reflect on your chosen solution and on alternative possible solutions for the problem you have chosen.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Online format of about 3000 words, but including at least 6 visualisations or appropriate analytics outputs</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To ensure the student can design, implement and execute a data processing task independently using the R language.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
