    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Test basic knowledge and understanding of data integrity.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Written exam held during the lecture time. If there is a change the students will be informed by UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be tested on their understanding of database, by creating the tables, defining all the contraints/intergrity rules.</Data></Cell>
