    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 9,  26 September 11:59pm</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This task involves the modelling and solution of two discrete/mixed optimisation problems. The student is required to develop the mathematical model of the problems, and apply advanced optimisation techniques such as exhaustive enumeration and Branch &amp; Bound algorithm to solve the problems, and submit these as an individual report. See the assignment document on Canvas for more details.</Data></Cell>
