   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32309</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Digital Forensics</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The quiz consists of a small number (10 - 20) of multiple choice questions. The quiz will explore the extent of your knowledge and understanding across the weekly topics. The questions will be taken from:  The Lecture slides and Readings for weeks 1 - 6. The Labs for Lectures 1 - 6.  To answer the questions correctly you need to understand the question topic. To do this you will need to attend the weekly lecture/discussion sessions, perform the weekly lab and discuss the lab questions with your group and read the weekly readings. There will be a quiz Q&amp;A document released two weeks before the quiz. There will be a practice quiz a week before the quiz.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In class</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In class in Week 7</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Case Study is a review of a Forensics topic of current interest. The topic is chosen from a list provided. You will need to research the topic online, download and explore some apps/tools and prepare a short demonstration. Your group will then submit the Case Study as a pdf by the due date. Your Case Study is aimed at adding knowledge to the material provided in class. You need to provide detail in depth so that other students can replicate your work. You need to submit your Case Study written Proposal as an upload in Week 8. The Case study Report is due in week 11. There will be a proposal guide released two weeks before the proposal is due and a Case Study Guide released two weeks before the Case Study is due.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case Study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study</Data></Cell>
