    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This will comprise short “written answer” questions. Time allocated will be advised week 9 : 60 - 80 minutes. This exam is a ”Restricted open book&quot; exam. Students may bring one double sided A4 sheet with handwritten notes. Calculators will not be allowed. This is an individual assessment.</Data></Cell>
