    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To spread the learning load evenly throughout the session; to test students' understanding of basic electronics concepts and provide timely feedback.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lab 1 - Lab Equipment Lab 2 - Noninverting and Inverting Amplifiers Lab 3 - Comparator, Integrator, Differentiator Lab 4 - Summing Amplifier, Precision Full-Wave Rectifier Lab 5 - Op-Amp Limitations Lab 6 - First-Order RC Circuits Lab 7 - First-Order RL Circuits Lab 8 - Waveform Generation Lab 9 - RLC Circuits Lab 10 - The Universal Filter</Data></Cell>
