    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Skills in microcontroller modules, serial I/O, non-volatile memory, interrupt handling, analog interfacing and PC connectivity.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Write a substantial embedded program that uses interrupts, timers, analog I/O and various other microcontroller peripherals to create a real-time, responsive system.  Students will be assessed individually.</Data></Cell>
