   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41175</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Emerging Topics in Quantum Information Science</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be assigned the task of preparing and presenting at a workshop at least once during the semester. The workshop presentation modes will be either based on panel discussions on the assigned topic or through a research presentation. Students will self-assess their own presentation in addition to the subject facilitator.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Workshop presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The presentation length is subject to change according to different topic, but will be approximately 15 minutes. Each week will consist of an individual presentation and a group panel discussion.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The workshop presentation will demonstrate the application of concepts, strategies and techniques learned from guest lectures and self-initiated study.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Prepare an EOI for a research proposal or business case for a potential project on a research topic of the student’s choice in quantum information science. This document will introduce the objectives, background, and strategic importance of the project. The EOI will include a reflective piece on why a particular topic was chosen and how it might relate to the student’s career identity, path or trajectory.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Expression of Interest for a research project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">750 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A project requiring the synthesis and analysis of a complex emerging topic in quantum information science.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Prepare a research proposal or business case for a project on a topic of the student’s choice in quantum information science. This proposal will detail the aims and objectives, survey the literature, discuss the strategic importance, and the research methodology to be implemented.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Research proposal/business case</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2500 words</Data></Cell>
