    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 11              11.59 pm Sunday</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59 pm Sunday</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is a team assessment task that documents and communicates your team’s design solution to a professional standard in an engineering report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Your EWB Challenge project team must give an online presentation to your tutorial class summarising and justifying your design solution. All team members are expected to speak as part of a coordinated oral presentation by your team. Visual aids in the form of a slideshow or similar are required to support your team’s presentation.</Data></Cell>
