    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students have engaged in opportunity to learn and understand the basics of MATLAB tools The quiz is designed to follow completion of the first few online modules which teach students basic MATLAB tools. Here students will determine their level of understanding and ability of these. The assessment has no marks and is completed out of class time.</Data></Cell>
