    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You must submit your documentation on CareerHub at least one week before your internship start date (domestic) or at least month before your departure date (international internships).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You must submit your documentation on CareerHub at least one week before your internship start date (domestic) or at least month before your departure date (international internships).</Data></Cell>
