    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Completeness – forms are filled out correctly. Timeliness – forms are submitted within the required time.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To gain timely enrolment in this subject and provide the necessary insurance cover.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">During your internship you are required to:  Create an ePortfolio with embedded reflective learning journal in UTSOnline (refer to instructions on UTSOnline how to complete this step) Write regular entries in your online reflective learning journal as per the instructions on UTSOnline. Submit your ePortfolio (containing your reflective learning journal) to the submission link in UTSOnline during weeks 4, 8, 12, 16, 20 and 24 of your internship. A random selection of 3 or 4 entries from your submissions will be marked according to the published assessment criteria. You must achieve an overall mark of 50% or more from this task in order to pass the subject.  For more details, refer to the instructions and resources on UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
