   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48130</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Engineering Experience 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will use an online portfolio to document and maintain evidence of their professional learning and development. Students will also post their entries to a discussion board to share experiences with other interns and to provide and receive feedback. Students should attach evidence for their learning and development. Evidence will be required for at least some claims in EE2 and will also be required for the EPR2 final report. Evidence may include photographs, screenshots, emails, technical drawings, documentation, awards, performance review, congratulatory emails, completed work, etc. Detailed instructions are on UTSOnline EE2. TASK 1.1 Internship Details Update your portfolio’s About Me page with details of your internship  TASK 1.2 Internship Goals   Find a mentor at your workplace and review your internship learning plan (from EPP2).  Update your plan and attach it to the GOALS section of your portfolio.  Add your mentor’s details to the About Me page of your portfolio.  Write a reflection on the process and results of your planning.   TASK 1.3 Performance Review  Arrange a face to face meeting with your supervisor to have an initial performance review. Write a reflection about this process and result of the review. You should focus on one competency or attribute that needs to be developed. Read one of your peer’s posted work and provide feedback based on your experiences.   TASK 1.4 Reflection Write a reflection on an experience at your internship that didn’t work out as well as you expected. What did you learn from it and how can you use that experience to be a more effective professional.  TASK 1.5 Reflection  Write a reflection on an experience at your internship that didn’t work out as well as you expected. What did you learn from it and how can you use that experience to be a more effective professional. Read one of your peer’s posted work and provide feedback based on your experiences.   TASK 1.6 Development Review your initial performance review, and the reflection you wrote about it, with your mentor or supervisor. Did you succeed in developing the area that you wanted to work on? Consider the effectiveness (or otherwise) of the plan you wrote in stage 4 of your reflection. If it worked,use the experience to write a Developing Competency Claim, or Developing Attribute Claim (as appropriate), If the plan didn’t work, why didn’t it work? Research a new method or tool you can use to develop this area, and write a new Stage 4 plan.  TASK 1.7 Final Reflection Reflect on your development as an engineer over the course of your internship. Consider a significant event, or sequence of events, that had a profound effect on you. What was it? What did you learn from it? How did it change you? How will you use this in the future?</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflect on Learnings and Development</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">100</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Task 1.1 End of 2nd week; Task 1.2 End of the 4th week; Task 1.3 End of the 8th week 8 of a 24 week internship (or 33% if a different period); Task 1.4 End of the 12th week of a 24 week internship (or 50% if a different period); Task 1.5 End of the 16th week of a 24 week internship (or 67% if a different period); Task 1.6 End of the 20th week of a 24 week internship (or 80%if a different period); Task 1.7 At the end of the Internship</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Task 1.1 End of 2nd week; Task 1.2 End of the 4th week; Task 1.3 End of the 8th week 8 of a 24 week internship (or 33% if a different period); Task 1.4 End of the 12th week of a 24 week internship (or 50% if a different period); Task 1.5 End of the 16th week of a 24 week internship (or 67% if a different period); Task 1.6 End of the 20th week of a 24 week internship (or 80%if a different period); Task 1.7 At the end of the Internship</Data></Cell>
