   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42003</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Engineering Graduate Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students write a professional report documenting their academic research projects. The report will include introduction, literature review, findings, discussions, conclusions and recommendations. The report should be formatted as suitable to submit to an academic journal, including references as per APA style. Students submit the final report via UTSOnline to document and evaluate their Graduate Project.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Project Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">100</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Length of the final report should have a body of at least 7000 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Draft Due: Week 4 (For formative feedback) Softcopy email to the supervisor.  Final report: 11:59 pm Monday 15 June 2020 submitted softcopy to UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Draft Due: Week 4 (For formative feedback) Softcopy email to the supervisor.  Final report: 11:59 pm Monday 15 June 2020 submitted softcopy to UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
