    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">These will be posted on UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To document, to academic standard, a professional engineering project to demonstrate competencies expected of an experienced professional engineer.</Data></Cell>
