   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48121</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Engineering Practice Preview 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1.1 Learning Review Activities (12% total) 1.1.1 - 1.1.6 Online Lecture Review Quizzes (6%) [each one is compulsory] 1.1.7 - 1.1.11 Tutorial In-Class Exercises (5%) [each one is compulsory] 1.1.12 EPR1 seminar In-Class Exercise (1%) [compulsory] 1.2 Academic Conduct Online Quiz (3%) [not compulsory] Online Lecture Review Quizzes These quizzes are available on UTSOnline in each lecture folder. The quiz only becomes visible once you have viewed the corresponding lecture video in full. The lecture videos are only available from 1:00AM Monday to 11:50PM Saturday (6 days only) as indicated in the program. You must obtain a score of at least 75% in the quiz to unlock the video for the next week. You have 3 attempts at each quiz. Failure to complete the quiz within the allocated time or failure to obtain the minimum score means that you will not be able to continue with the subject. Tutorial In-Class Exercises These are handed out in each tutorial and must be satifactorily completed within the tutorial session, then handed to the tutor at the end. This also serves as a record of your attendance at the tutorial.</Data></Cell>
