    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2.1 Resume 25% 2.1.1 Resume (version 1) and peer evaluation 5% 2.1.2 Resume (version 2) formative tutor evaluation 2.1.3 Resume (version 3) Submission 20% 2.1.4 Resume (version 4) Re-submission (if required) - max. mark 10 2.1.5 Resume (version 5) Re-submission (if required) - max. mark 5 2.2 Job Application Letter – 15%  Resume You have 5 attempts in this subject to achieve a resume which is deemed to be &quot;competitive&quot; for a junior engineering internship. If your resume is not competitive you will not be granted access to careerhub to view internships.</Data></Cell>
