    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Your group should prepare (and practise), an 8 minute group oral presentation that will be presented during the last tutorial session to your colleagues. Your presentation should:  briefly describe the engineer and workplace your group visited share what you discovered, with similarities and differences from your individual expectations.  All students of each group must participate in this presentation. A copy of the marking sheet for this assessment task is given in the relevent section on UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
