    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You have been enrolled in a site on UTSOnline called 'academic conduct'. Review the resource materials provided. Students are then required to complete the Online multilpe choice quiz to ensure they have an understanding of the relevent academic conducat and related procedures. Students are required to get a minimum of 17/20 for this quiz. Multiple attempts are allowed.</Data></Cell>
