   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48122</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Engineering Practice Review 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Participation / Attendance at all of the following is compulsory and is a pass requirement of the subject as it involves teamwork, exchange of ideas and experience with your colleagues:  online lecture activity during weeks 1 and 2 - instructions are on UTSOnline. This is an individual activity Two tutorial sessions: First one in week 4 (3 hours) and the second one in week 7 (3 hours). Students will partake in a peer review of a draft/final internship report, which allows them to engage in a process of constructive feedback, with the aim of producing a report of a high standard One seminar session in either weeks 9, 10 or 11 (3 hours). This is a collaborative activity in a small group of up to 8 EPR1 students and some EPP1 students. Students are encouraged to provide constructive feedback on each other's work.  Students must ensure that they are allocated to the above activities using My Student Admin and attend their scheduled sessions. Failure to participate in / attend any one of the above sessions means students will not be able to pass the subject.</Data></Cell>
