    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Submit a draft report before the first tutorial. Guidelines on the minimum requirements for the draft report are in the learning guide on UTSOnline. The report must be submitted prior to your first tutorial session. Late submissions will not be accepted.</Data></Cell>
