    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">OVERVIEW Write an Internship Report where you:  Describe and reflect on (with a strong emphasis on the latter) your experience and what you learned in relation to the objectives of the first internship (as specificied in the Subject Description and Subject Objectives of this document, as well as the Learning Guide). Demonstrate how you are integrating the academic activities with your personal, professional and technical development. Demonstrate that you are adequately developing technical competence, social responsibility and a foundation for ethical practice. Identify your current competencies in relation to the Engineers Australia Australian Engineering Competency Standards Stage 2 (2012). Provide evidence that you added value to your workplace and to the community. Review your employment process and make plans for the future.  More details are in the learning guide on UTSOnline It is vital that you submit your final report before coming to your second tutorial so that you can receive feedback on it. Late submission will attract a late penalty of 10% per day or part thereof. Submissions received after your second tutorial session are deemed to be a final submission and will not be afforded a resubmission opportunity.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Internship Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">refer to program</Data></Cell>
