    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">These are detailed in the learning guide</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Make a 10-minute presentation - based on your internship activities - that critically reviews your experience, highlights your contributions to your workplace, your development as a future engineer . You should be prepared to answer questions from the audience, comprising other 48122 EPR1 students presenting in the same session, as well as 48121 EPP1 students and the session facilitator. There may be other staff members present as well as industry representatives. Details are contained in the learning guide</Data></Cell>
