    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When you reach the end of your internship, you must finalise the placement by submitting the Evaluation Form on CareerHub. Once submitted the system will generate an email to your supervisor with a link for them to fill out the Host Organisation Evaluation Form. These forms must be submitted within two weeks after the internship finish date. It is your responsibility to ensure that both forms &#45;- yours and your host organisation &#45;- are submitted in a timely manner. You cannot pass 41036 EPE1 unless both you and your employer submit the Evaluation Forms.</Data></Cell>
