    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This item assesses a student’s oral communication skills and ability to present arguments clearly and concisely to specialist and non-specialist audiences.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The final exam will be a formal restricted open book exam. Students are permitted to take into the exam two A4 pages of double sided notes. The exam will be held at a time decided by the exams branch. The exam may include any material discussed in lectures as well as the subject material presented online, in tutorials, in subject notes or in the group project.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final exam</Data></Cell>
