    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59pm Sunday 7 June 2020              Submitted softcopy to UTSonline</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This task aims to test student’s ability of applying research methodology and controlling project progress in the following capstone subject 41030. This task also aims to strengthen student’s capability of synthesise solutions from different perspectives.</Data></Cell>
