   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41028</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Engineering Work Experience</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students collect information and artefacts during their work placement. The information and artefacts should be:  Written records of workplans and performance appraisals from the beginning, middle and end of their work placement Written records of critical incidents from their work placement. This may include photographs, observations, stories, and artefacts Reflections on their experience of the monthly huddles  The artefacts need to be collected and curated in an eportfolio. These artefacts will be developed and submitted as assessment in the subsequent subject 41055 Engineering Workplace Review.</Data></Cell>
