    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purpose of this task is to demonstrate that you can effectively present enterprise architecture project artefacts to the intended audience and being able to answer relevant queries and questions.</Data></Cell>
