   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32571</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Enterprise Software Testing</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will carry out standard a Static Test and create an FMEA which are fundamental building blocks of any test process. The assignment will require students to review documents describing business needs and create a static analysis, FMEA risk register using templates provided. Assessment documents must be submitted using Turnitin</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">FMEA &amp; Static testing</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19/08/2019, 11:59pm</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19/08/2019, 11:59pm</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will use exploratory testing (a standard Agile test process) to seek to understand a system, not just bugs but operational and functional capabilities. Assessment documents must be submitted using Turnitin.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exploratory Test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
