   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48270</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Entrepreneurship and Commercialisation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Within a market of choice, understand the existing competition and identify Porter’s five forces in the market. Explore opportunities in the market through a chosen strategy and outline the potential challenges that can be faced.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Part A: Market Analysis</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1500 - 2000 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24/08/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59pm Monday 24 August 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To understand a particular market and its competition. Based on the situation of the market, this assessment will prepare students to identify new opportunities for a start-up or an existing business and possible threats before starting a business plan.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Create a one-minute video pitch based on a business idea in your chosen market. Review the pitches of 2 peers who will be randomly allocated.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Part B: Video Pitch and Peer Review</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One-minute video and constructive feedback</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM, Friday 4th September (Video) &amp; 11:59 PM, Friday 11th September (Feedback to two video pitches)See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM, Friday 4th September (Video) &amp; 11:59 PM, Friday 11th September (Feedback to two video pitches)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To explore opportunities in a particular market and pitch verbally (video format). This assessment will also allow students to review peers’ videos and provide feedback.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In a group of three, develop a business plan.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Business Plan</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Maximum 40 pages and appendices</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25/10/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59pm Sunday 25 October 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop a business plan for a start-up business or a new product or service of an existing business.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pitch the business plan individually and answer one of the questions (a list of questions will be provided before the end of the session).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pitch and Viva Voce</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2-minute Pitch plus 5 minutes for oral exam</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
