    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Environmental Assessment and Planning</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The student will be required to: 1. Undertake the equivalent of an environmental study to site a Residential Neighbourhood on a 'greenfield' (rural) site on an Orthophotomap (scale 1: 4,000) provided; and 2. Prepare a planning report to the relevant Council with regard to the proposed site. This report is to include supporting documentation and selected maps/plans.</Data></Cell>
