    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To assess how students know about environmental biotechnology (the need, fundamental scientific and engineering principles) and applications.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purposes of the task are to provide students a real-life situation to know better and deeper about present environmental processes and technological advances in environmental biotechnology. Through this task, students will experience the true art of biotechnology. They will also gain the competence of justifying and evaluating the key technology based on technical, environmental, economic and social-culture criteria.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Practical Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group written report (maximum 20 pages for each assignment)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 14</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students are divided into groups and are required to participate in an organised field trip to either water industry or waste industry. After the visit, each group of students are requested to select one most interesting biotechnology during the field trip and present their finding, analysis and evaluations in the report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Closed-book exam and all topics covered in the exam.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Formal Final Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3 hours + 10 minutes reading time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To assess how students know about different biotechnologies for sustainable water and waste treatment, biomaterial and bioenergy recovery, and bioremediation of existing contaminants.</Data></Cell>
