    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Environmental Planning and Law</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The open-book exam duration is 2 hours. It will consist of short answer and multiple choice questions. All materials covered in the subject will be examinable.</Data></Cell>
