    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this assignment, students will select and critically analyse an environmental law case or dispute involving development planning. A suggested list of case studies will be available to students. Students will write a report that discusses the relevant environmental legislations and propose strategies to resolve the legal conflicts. Students are encouraged to draw similarities and adapt approaches from precedent cases or court decisions as reported in the literature.</Data></Cell>
