   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41163</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fundamentals of Biomedical Engineering Studio B</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There are several different kinds of projects for students to select. After selecting a project, the students are asked to design a functional solution, write a report and pitch their solution.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Health Innovation project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In week 2,3,4 and 5 you will partake in a weekly observation of the work done in each session, with marks given in class based on the student’s effort each week. (10%);  Week 5 Health Innovation project report due on 22/8/19 at 23/59 in Turnitin via UTSOnline (25%);  Week 6 Health Innovation project pitching in class on 27/08/2019 (15%).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In week 2,3,4 and 5 you will partake in a weekly observation of the work done in each session, with marks given in class based on the student’s effort each week. (10%);  Week 5 Health Innovation project report due on 22/8/19 at 23/59 in Turnitin via UTSOnline (25%);  Week 6 Health Innovation project pitching in class on 27/08/2019 (15%).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Demonstration of team and individual ability of design/implementation of an innovative health solution and demonstration of the ability to communicate effectively with peers and general audiences.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There are several different kinds of projects for students to select. After selecting a project, the students are asked to design a functional solution, write a report and pitch their solution.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Biomaterials or Biomechanics project</Data></Cell>
