    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In week 9, you will present your initial Biomaterials or Biomechanics project in class on Monday (10%); In Week 11, Biomaterials or Biomechanics project report due on 08/10/19 at 23/59 in turnitin via UTSonline (30%); Week 12, Biomaterials or Biomechanics project presentations in class on 15/10/2019 (10%).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In week 9, you will present your initial Biomaterials or Biomechanics project in class on Monday (10%); In Week 11, Biomaterials or Biomechanics project report due on 08/10/19 at 23/59 in turnitin via UTSonline (30%); Week 12, Biomaterials or Biomechanics project presentations in class on 15/10/2019 (10%).</Data></Cell>
