    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To test basic knowledge of a range of topics thoughout the subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Test objectives:  understanding of the fundamental formulae in Electrical Engineering practice of those formulae to solve engineeing problems.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Exam</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There are 4 questions and each question is worth 25 marks. Maximum 20 pages.</Data></Cell>
