   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31102</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Game Design Studio 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There are 3 separate quizzes scheduled throughout the semester. Each quiz is worth 5%. These will be completed during the regularly scheduled lecture time and will last approximately 30 minutes. Questions will cover the material covered in the lectures and as part of assigned reading. The written quiz will mostly be in the form of short-answer questions. No outside material is allowed.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Short Quizzes</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In class in Week 4, Week 8 and Week 11.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In class in Week 4, Week 8 and Week 11.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Measure progress and understanding of the subject material</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You will work on a major game project as a team. The work will be divided into 4 Sprints. Each Sprint is worth 15%.  For each Sprint, you will be required to set tasks to be completed by the end of the Sprint, estimate the amount of time you expect the tasks to take, record the tasks as they are completed and submit a Sprint report. Also, you must write a group and an individual reflection following the Recount-React-Analyse pattern. Sprint report templates with samples will be provided via UTSOnline. Intermediate deliverables: Sprint reports and demos of work in-progress. Final deliverables: Presentation and report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Team Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
