    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12              All code, assets and documents submitted through UTSOnline by Friday midnight (11:59PM) of Week 6, Week 8, Week 10 and Week 12. For this assessment, 50% of the grade will be determined by the group's overall performance and the 50% will be determined by each member's contribution.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All code, assets and documents submitted through UTSOnline by Friday midnight (11:59PM) of Week 6, Week 8, Week 10 and Week 12. For this assessment, 50% of the grade will be determined by the group's overall performance and the 50% will be determined by each member's contribution.</Data></Cell>
