    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There are 4 separate deliverables for this assessment: 1- Build an Arcade Game from the 80s (from Scratch) and document the process (includes reflection) (5%); 2- Build an Arcade Game from the 90s (from Scratch) in teams using SCRUM (includes reflection) (5%); 3 - Build a Game to Client Specifications (Part 1). Design a Simple Game, Write User Stories and Find a Team that Builds your Game (5%); 4 - Build a Game to Client Specifications (Part 2). Implement a Game Following the User Stories written by another team (10%).</Data></Cell>
