   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48661</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heat Transfer</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz 1:   Topics: Introduction to Heat Transfer, Introduction to Conduction, One-dimensional Steady-state Conduction, and Transient Conduction Open-book (any materials of print, typed, or written type can be used) There will be two questions.  Programmable calculators are allowed Duration: 45 minutes Quiz will be held during lecture time  Quiz 2:   Topics: Introduction to Convection, and External Flow Open-book (any materials of print, typed, or written type can be used) There will be two questions.  Programmable calculators are allowed Duration: 45 minutes Quiz will be held during lecture time  Quiz 3:   Topics: Internal Flow, and Free Convection Open-book (any materials of print, typed, or written type can be used) There will be two questions.  Programmable calculators are allowed Duration: 45 minutes Quiz will be held during lecture time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Three Quizzes of 10% each</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
