    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To provide students with an awareness of human-centred research methods as taught in this subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The assignment requires students to independently study and develop a research proposal, followed by contacting potential participants and performing in-depth interviews. Afterwards, students are encouraged to learn substantial methods for the analysis of data and its reporting. Tutorials and class meetings give students the opportunity to receive guidance and feedback on their progress.</Data></Cell>
