    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">01:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1.00pm Thursday 22 October 2020              Submission is through Turnitin in Canvas before 1pm on Thursday 22 October.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To provide students with the opportunity to put into practice and further develop skills in human-centred research. Following the direction set out in task 2, this task approaches similar research questions with another qualitative research tool, namely cultural probes. Students will learn its application and analysis, and communication of findings.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Submission is through Turnitin in Canvas before 1pm on Thursday 22 October.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will select one or more of the papers from the provided reading list, read it, analyse it and then present their findings in class time.</Data></Cell>
