    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41192</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">IS Value Creation Studio</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Develop a portfolio showing the process followed by the team Develop a macro model of a system as a team ldentify what stakeholders see as issues Develop stakeholder persona and journey maps Decompose into problem into a system of systems, with each system delivering value to its stakeholders Develop design brief for each system Develop a conceptual solution for each system showing ways technology is used to provide value</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
