   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41065</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">IT Experience Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">During the work integrated learning program students will have developed an ePortfolio containing numerous reflections and evidence for both graduate attribute and SFIA competency claims. In this assessment students will update this portfolio, to demonstrate their competencies to potential employers. Students will update their CV and About Me section summarising their competency claims, this should be 1000 words. Students will write one last reflection on their internship experiences as a whole. Discussing the basics of their role, any key incidents, their opinions on their time as an intern, lessons learned etc. This should be 1000 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ePortfolio</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Portfolio</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2000 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Draft: 30 March 2020 (Week 4), Final: 4 May 2020 11:59pm (Week 8)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Draft: 30 March 2020 (Week 4), Final: 4 May 2020 11:59pm (Week 8)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Broaden understanding of IT work experience; summarise and reflect on the experience gained during the IT practice program; and improve understanding of competency claims.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will present in seminars describing:  where their internship took place and the students’ role in the company; the students’ hopes and expectations on joining the company; what the student actually experienced when he/she joined; their future plans as an IT professional; Advice for a future intern.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Viva Voce</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10 minutes</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final seminar (Week 11)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final seminar (Week 11)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To assess students’ ability to verbally establish a professional identity and to discuss aspects of interest about their professional experience.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
