   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31097</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">IT Operations Management</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The task is to write a busines proposal to present to an organization's Investment Review Board in relation to a set case study. The proposal should argue the case giving both arguements for and against the proposal and should examine some alternatives. Full details can be found on UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Business Proposal</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approximately 13 - 15 pages</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">01:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1.00pm Sunday 12 April 2020              Assignment to be submitted in soft copy to your tutor's UTS email account</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment to be submitted in soft copy to your tutor's UTS email account</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The task is to prepare a report for senior management arguing the cases for and against establishing relevant departments as part of an IT Operations Department. The submission should additionally provide the author's opinion in relation to the new departments.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Business Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approximately 10 - 15+ pages.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24/05/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">01:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1.00pm Sunday 24 May 2020              Assignment to be submitted in soft copy to your tutor's UTS email account</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment to be submitted in soft copy to your tutor's UTS email account</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be assessed on their ongoing contribution both during tutorials and group meetings. The assessment will include conduct and contribution at meetings, meeting of deadlines, and provision of working materials and documentation, including agendas, minutes, etc, as required by the tutor. Non-attendance at tutorial and group meetings will be a factor in the assessment of this task.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Class / Tutorial Participation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not applicable</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not applicable</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students should read the lecture notes and relevant chapters of the recommended textbook covered in the lectures. Also they must bring their student ID to be able to sit in the exam. The exam is open book and permitted materials are lecture notes, notes and textbook.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Exam</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam Period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
