   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31491</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Industry Project 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1) Consult / discuss with your academic mentors on your progress (Meeting with academic mentors and Industry mentors must be organised by the student at their work place. First meeting by 14 Agust 2015 and second meeting (if required) by 09 October 2015. If the meeting at the work place is not feasible then a conference call or any other relevant communication mechanisim can be used. 2) Participate in mini presentation at the University (Contact Anna Mrsic at Anna.Mrsic@uts.edu.au for the dates and inform your academic mentors about your mini presentation). 3) Produce an industry project report about your experience and involvement in various activities at the sponsoring organisation during the industry placement. 4) Present outcomes in a seminar at their workplace (students must invite their academic mentors for the final presentation at their work place).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Journal and Reflection Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">100</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no word limit.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">On goingSee also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">On going</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Criteria is based on a report received from the Industry Manager.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Industry project report is a reflective component and includes: what was learnt, how was it learnt, how did it benefit to you, and specific issues identified in industry placement such as communication problems, workplace behaviour and requirements etc.</Data></Cell>
