   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31492</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Industry Project 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Apply theoretical knowledge and skills on workplace projects and problems and reflect on the outcomes. Apply problem-solving, critical reasoning and professional skills to produce valid and useful outcomes.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Industry problems and projects</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no word limit.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14/07/2017</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Friday 14 July 2017              The report can be completed and submitted prior to the deadline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The report can be completed and submitted prior to the deadline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Self motivation Team skills Perseverance Productivity Technical judegment Work standard Self-organization</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Apply theoretical knowledge and skills as appropriate to perform workplace projects as directed.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Give a presentation summarising your overall workplace experience to your industry sponsor, academic mentor, peers and others who may be interested.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Industry presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">0</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">While there is no required length, a guide is that the presentation should be between 20 and 30 minutes, followed by questions and discussion.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14/07/2017</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Friday 14 July 2017              Presentations can be at any time prior to the due date.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentations can be at any time prior to the due date.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation skills Self-review</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Communicate a summary and analysis of the overall workplace experience to an audience of peers, industry sponsors and academci mentors.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Provide examples, reports, samples, extracts, descriptions or other material to support the industry sponsor's assessment of your achievements during placement.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Workplace reflection report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no required or pre-determined length.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14/07/2017</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Friday 14 July 2017</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Document relevant information about the workplace experience, projects and problems to provide evidence and support for the industry sponsor assessment.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
