   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31257</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Information System Development Methodologies</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Practice for developing an Information System for a Business Application Project (e.g. Health Information System) documenting the steps involved. Details of the project is available to students in Week 2.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Class Quiz</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 6</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assessment details and marking criteria can be found in UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Prepare a report for the development methodology of a business system. Students are required to argue for their proposed approach by comparing aspects of methodologies and outlining the benefits and drawbacks of each. Students present their proposal to the class. Weight: 30% (Group Report 30%, Individual Presentation 10%)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project Report and Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Report should not be more than 2000 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 11              Oral Presentation Weeks 11 &amp; 12</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oral Presentation Weeks 11 &amp; 12</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assessment task 2: Project Report and Presentation</Data></Cell>
