    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32208</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Information Systems Strategy</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assessed throughout the semester. Students' on-going class participation will be assessed against questions and answering in the class as well as active group participation in case studies and class activities. 1 mark will be granted for an active participation in each teaching week, with a total of 10 marks for the whole semester</Data></Cell>
