    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment will be marked weekly in the class based on students' active participation in the group discussion, their level of attempting case study and discussion questions, and effective communication and class presentation.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To demonstrate in-depth understanding of the concept of information systems strategy, on which the scholarly articles and industrial case studies are based on.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is an individual assessment. Students will be asked to prepare a report and demonstrate their understanding of short-answer questions as well as case study questions. Full details will be available at the UTSOnline</Data></Cell>
