    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual assessment of preparation for class sessions and level of performance in class exercises. This mark is based on: Preparation for all class sessions – this may be evaluated by class participation.Performance in class exercises and delivery of required outcomes from those activities.</Data></Cell>
