    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wednesday 30 May 2018              30/5 however the due date is negotiable due to proposal submission and feedback delay. Likely range from Week 8 to Week 13 (proposal, initial and final submission, peer review). Proposal feedback and marks will be provided within a week, feedback and marks for the full project will be available within two weeks after completion.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment -2 is a group based assignment, which is assessed based on a group and individual performance.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
