   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31258</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innovations for Global Relationship Management</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will write a report on the inhibitors to successful deployment of IT innovation and how technology changes and affects business structure. Refer assignment instructions under ‘Assignments’ in UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 1 (Group Assignment)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Maximum wordcount is 2,500 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment due by start of your tutorial in Week 6See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment due by start of your tutorial in Week 6</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Research Report. This is a group assignment with 3 students from the same tutorial class. To be successful in this assignment you need to exhibit analysis of your research in all your discussions, and then the deductions resulting from that analysis. 2,500 words max.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will write a report on the elements to be included while developing a contract for outsourcing IT operations and IT management. Refer assignment instructions under ‘Assignments’ in UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 2 (Group Assignment)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Maximum word count 2,500 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment due by start of your tutorial in Week 11See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment due by start of your tutorial in Week 11</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group written research report (15%) and Individual oral presentation (10%) (Marked Individually for your part of your Group’s presentation). To be successful in this assignment you need to exhibit analysis of your research in all your discussions, and then the deductions resulting from that analysis. 2,500 words max.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The examination will include materials discussed in the class, tutorials and assessment tasks. Final examination is restricted open book - Students are permitted to take into the exam two A4 pages of double sided notes.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
