   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32029</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Interactive Arts</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report discussing aspirations, techniques and tools of the particular genre of interactive art addressed in the project.</Data></Cell>
