   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32516</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Internet Programming</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is an individual programming assignment where students have to demonstrate the use of advanced HTML, CSS, PHP, MySQL and JavaScript to solve the given problems in the design and the implementation of a website. The assignment consists of four components (or tasks) and addresses objectives 1, 2, 3, 6 and 7.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Website Design Assignment</Data></Cell>
