    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To provide students with the opportunity to observe and learn about the great variety of contemporary Internet research activity, and to have to freedom to follow their interests within broad parameters.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be working in teams of up to 4. To write a report describing your answers to the weekly in-lab task, as well as a write up of the findings from the open ended investigation you will conduct on the Data Set you have selected.</Data></Cell>
