   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31261</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Internetworking Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Record all the development efforts towards the project, such as the time committed, issues addressed, completed or attempted, results (fail or success) in respective to the project plan, and supervisor feedback on a weekly basis, and the alterations to the original plan in the proposal with justification.</Data></Cell>
