    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This item is for assessing group members’ participations, ability to manage time and processes, prioritizing competing demands to achieve the required goals and objectives.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The group is required to submit an interim report demonstrating to the project supervisor/assessor that the group knows what it is needed to be done. Each group must also demonstrate a sensible and realistic plan for their project for the remainder of the semester.</Data></Cell>
