    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This item is for checking that the group members have a clear idea of the requirements and specifications of the project and a feasible project plan.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The group is required to submit an up-to-date report and (partial) technical design or source code to demonstrate to the project supervisor/assessor.</Data></Cell>
