    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This item occurs during the four (4) main meetings with supervisor. During each major meeting, the supervisor and participants meet at an agreed time and place. The logbook needs to record each session.</Data></Cell>
