    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is for participants to enhance their communication skills, defend the major professional decisions/judgments and demonstrate the continuous development of the project.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Each group as a whole is required to submit a Written Report and any other relevant materials of the design and/or source code of their work. Submission should contain the design and/or source code itself and a fully documented user manual of how to run any code and/or how the designed system operates. The Written Report, with each members' contribution clearly identified, will need to be submitted to the supervisor in a hard copy for marking, and in a soft copy to Turnitin on UTSOnline for the detection of plagiarism.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
