    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29/05/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:59 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.59pm Friday 29 May 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is for participants to summarise and reflect what they have done in the project. The report should be of a format and standard appropriate for delivery of an industry project or research project, as appropriate.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The group should contact their supervisor and book a time slot for the presentation and demonstration with the supervisor and assessor. The students are required to present what they have done for the project and demonstrate that the system meets the final set of requirements as described in its report. The students are required to bring a copy of their report submitted earlier and making reference to it during their demo. During the Presentation, each member is to present his or her part and a set of project-specific as well as general knowledge questions will be asked, and each group member is expected to answer questions individually. Note that it is the student’s responsibility to sort out any infrastructure issues, such as networking equipment, laptops etc. for the demonstrations. This task is an individually assessed task with each student given an individual mark according to their contribution.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation and Demonstration</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
