   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48210</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Interrogating Technology: Sustainability, Environment and Social Change</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purpose of this Assessment Task is to look at technological development and engineering from the ‘outside’. In groups, you are asked to investigate and title a contemporary issue of interest that has enough scope to support an in-deepth stakeholder consultation. The group will then locate three to six significant articles including news reports about this issue. In your group you will be representing one stakeholder for which you are then asked to summarise the relevant article. As a group, you will analyse what is being reported in all three to six of these articles in order to write a strong case for consultation. The format of the stakeholder consultation submission will be provided on CANVAS. This is a group submission. The weighting is 25% (15% on group report + 5% on assigned report section + 5% on contribution to group presentation).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Stakeholder consultation submission</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2000 words +/- 5% excluding reference list</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25/09/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">04:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4.00pm Friday 25 September 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To examine how technological change is being discussed and understood in the public arena. Be reflexive about own perspectives and therefore more conscious as a professional who engages with stakeholders and non-engineers in the future.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Read, write, think and reflect about the relationship between technology and society. Reading material with sets of questions will be provided during the sessions. You will be required to respond to each of them using the posting site on CANVAS The learning portfolio consists of personal reflections on your strategy for learning, your progress and your overall experience This is an individual submission.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Learning portfolio submission</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exercises</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approximately 1000 words excluding list of references</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">09/10/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">04:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4.00pm Friday 9 October 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To monitor the development of students' ‘social literacy’.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment task involves writing a policy position paper on behalf of your assigned stakeholder. This will be undertaken in three parts. The first is the development of a detailed policy position paper using your selection of current, relevant, authoritative and purposeful documents. The second part takes form of a constructive debate among your group members (who have been assigned to other stakeholders). The third part is to reflect on the conduct and outcomes of the debate in order to contrast and strengthened your policy position paper. This is an individual submission.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Policy Position Paper submission</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1500 words +/- 5% excluding reference list</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23/10/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
