   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41040</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Introduction to Artificial Intelligence</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Complete quiz questions during the class.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quizzes</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Week 4, Week 8 and Week 12 tutorial classes</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Week 4, Week 8 and Week 12 tutorial classes</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Provide an opportunity for students to challenge their understanding of concepts and key ideas of artificial intelligence techniques.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In lab sessions, students will develop solutions by applying their knowledge to train an artificial intelligence model. Groups will compete to each other in terms of how accurately and appropriately the model they build can solve the problem posed. Several iterations of this competitive learning context will be interspersed with opportunities for peer and tutor feedback.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lab practice for common AI techniques</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
