    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To understand computational intelligent theory and operation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will apply algorithms from examples and apply it to public datasets. During the laboratory class, students will fine-tune the algorithms until results meet stated criteria. A written report will accompany the code. The report will include an aim, method, results and discussion of the solution achieved, along with a critical reflection on the advantages and drawbacks of the approach undertaken.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lab practice for computational intelligent models on public data</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Submission:  A fully functional code with comment An experimental report – length/required sections?</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
