   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31262</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Introduction to Computer Game Design</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is a group assignment. Design and construct a board game in a randomly assigned group. This assessment evaluates students' abilities to brainstorm and negotiate ideas with diverse group members and then effectively playtest and enhance your designs in an iterative cycle. The grade is divided between the overall quality of the game (as playtested by other students in the class) as well as the documentation that each group member keeps about the design and playtest process. Details will be provided in a separate assignment specification sheet.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Design &amp; Build a Board Game</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
