    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Released - Week 3.  Report due on Canvas by the end of Week 7 (Friday 1st May, before 11:59pm).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is a group assignment. Design a digital game as a group using a modern game engine. This is a chance for students to reinforce what they learned in the board game assessment and go further with more complexity in their game design, scoping their designs to be within the skill set of their group, and overcoming software development challenges in a digital game engine. Again, the grade will be divided between the overall quality of the game and the documentation that is kept throughout the iterative design process. Details will be provided in a separate assignment specification sheet.</Data></Cell>
