    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mon 30 March 2020, 11:00AM (Quiz 1); Mon 27 April 2020, 11:00AM (Quiz 2);  Mon 18 May 2020, 11:00AM (Quiz 3);  Mon 1 June 2020, 11:00AM (Quiz 4)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students apply their knowledge of combinational logic, sequential logic and microcontrollers to solve problems.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricted open book final examination on the fundamental concepts of introductory digital hardware design and programming.</Data></Cell>
