   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42037</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">IoT Security</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The students will be assigned tasks to use Contiki software to simulate some problems related IoT security applications. Lab tasks are from Week 1 to Week 5. Lab test is on Week 6. The students will perform their tasks individually in the studio.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 6</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The lab presentation will provide the opportunity for students to demonstrate their ability to develop IoT security solutions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The students will have a quiz on Week 7. This quiz may include both short answer and multiple choices types. The students will answer questions related to knowledge learned from Week 1 to Week 5 and submit to the lecturer in the end of class. Results and feedbacks for the quiz will be given in Week 9.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
