   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49108</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Local Government Powers and Practice</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be required to undertake an investigation and determine a feasible solution to a 'problem' local government engineers are confronted with from time-to-time in their workplace in New South Wales. The student will be required to address both civil engineering aspects and legislative requirements applicable to ensure the task is effected.</Data></Cell>
