    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students are encouraged to solve as many problems as possible. They should at the very least solve all the problems in Assignment 1 by adhering to the recommended procedure. Students are required to attend Quiz 1 to independently solve one problem related to velocity analysis.</Data></Cell>
