    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Please see the Marking Criteria for Project Reports of 48621 Manufacturing Engineering in the folder of “Lab1-Projects” at UTSOnline. * The Marking Criteria for Project Reports of 48621 must be used with this Subject Outline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To enable students to practice several basic manufacturing processes by fabricating simple products.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Written Report Due on 23:59, Saturday of Week 9. Please note Fabrication and run of the pump will be assessed in each Lab1 activity in Week 8.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be able to calibrate and record measurements using complex and non-complex technologies in the metrology laboratory.</Data></Cell>
