    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To enable students to understand the fundamental principles of measurement and their importance to our day-to-day lives, to understand the importance of standards and their relevance to manufacturing engineering, and to develop the ability to calibrate and record measurements using complex and non-complex technologies provided in the laboratory.</Data></Cell>
