    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Format: Individual assignment. Development of a marketing plan for a new product or service relevant to your employers industry. Scenario: Your company has come to a crossroads, a new product set, service or opportunity is needed to ensure future growth. Your challenge is to identify a new market segment and develop a marketing plan exploit that opportunity. Marketing plan requirements: Develop a comprehensive marketing plan based on the template provided in the first lecture. Also include a brief introduction that describes the organisation and its marketing within its industry context. It is critical that you demonstrate an understanding of the marketing concepts covered in the course by applying them to your proposed product or service. Criteria: • Has the student set the organisational and industry context for the marketing plan – including identification of any constraints or structural industry opportunities. • Identification of product or service, value proposition and market positioning (ideally from Assignment 2) • Are all relevant sections of the marketing plan completed fully and are the key marketing concepts applied effectively? • Is the marketing plan logical and well structured, do the conclusions follow logically from the plan?</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
