    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 13</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting the organisational and industry context for the marketing plan – including identification of any constraints or structural industry opportunities. Creativity in developing a product and solution; is the value proposition realistic and communicated well? Are all relevant sections of the marketing plan completed fully and are the key marketing concepts applied effectively? Is the marketing plan logical and well structured? Does the presentation communicate effectively the key elements of the new product and plan? Is the presentation entertaining?</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assignment gives you the opportunity to apply marketing concepts to your organisation. You will develop a comprehensive marketing plan for a new service or product for your organisation or industry.</Data></Cell>
