    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Build design, development, and implementation skills.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The exam is in the form of multiple choice, short answer questions, plus system design and evaluation problems. It covers specified chapters, lectures, learning materials, and tutorials. Requires application of knowledge, techniques, evaluation, and resources to solve problems.</Data></Cell>
