   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31274</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Network Management</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quizzes will be conducted in class sessions in the weeks shown. Each quiz will consist of multiple choice and true/false type questions, and will be closed book.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Online quizzes</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz 1 (3%) in the lab in week 4; Quiz 2 (3%) in the lab in week 6; Quiz 3 (4%) in the lab in week 8.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz 1 (3%) in the lab in week 4; Quiz 2 (3%) in the lab in week 6; Quiz 3 (4%) in the lab in week 8.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quizzes are used in this subject to help students receive regular feedback on their learning of the weekly topics.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Groups of students will undertake the task of developing network management solutions for a case study given to them. Students are required to prepare a report and demonstrate their solution.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project (Case Study)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18/05/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Monday 18 May 2020              Report due on 18/05/2020 (week 10) via online submission. Project presentations will take place in the lab of weeks 10, 11, and 12.See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report due on 18/05/2020 (week 10) via online submission. Project presentations will take place in the lab of weeks 10, 11, and 12.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The case study project will involve students working in groups to explore a case study based on a current industry scenario, and will be required to develop network management solutions for the case study. This allows students to engage with network management problems faced by practicing professionals.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The skills exam will test the knowledge and skills that the student has learned from the lab exercises and also require them to demonstrate lab based activities. This is a group based activity, although marks will be assigned individually.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Skill Examination</Data></Cell>
