    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is a group based activity.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The skills examination allows students to demonstrate their proficiency with using network management tools to manage a small to medium sized network, using industry-recognised tools.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Skills test will be conducted in the lab of week 9</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The final exam will consist of short answer type questions. The material examined will cover weeks 2 to 12.</Data></Cell>
