    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Networked Enterprise Architecture</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Discussion and analysis of a topic related to the lecture in the online discussion forum by posting answers/comments. These topics will explore key topics supporting/complementing the subject matter. Students are expected to individually contribute once per post. Posts should extend the conversation by introducing a new point of view or piece of information that furthers the discussion.</Data></Cell>
