    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pollution Control and Waste Management</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will have an opportunity to ask questions and solve problems and engage in group discussions during the face-to-face sessions based on pre-work tasks and questions raised in class. This quiz will evaluate students' understanding of these question as well as the ability of undertaking research, reading, analyisng information, attempting tutorial questions.</Data></Cell>
