   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31136</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Preparation for and Review of IT Experience</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SWOT Analysis: Please reflect on your 4.5 months of work experience to identify your (SWOT). Write down at least 7 to 8 points under each header. Report: A 4000 word report, the first paragraph should introduce yourself and what you do in the organisation. Latter content should be an expansion of your SWOT analysis. A sample page of your learning diary. (You are advised to maintain a diary to keep track of your learning activities. Please provide 6 – 8 entries which you deem as important.  These 3 deliverables should be submitted as one document. Example 1 Assessment item has 3 sub components.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Swot analysis, report, diary</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">100</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The whole deliverable should be in a single word file with a word limit of 4000 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All assessments are due 4.5 months after the start of your internship</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All assessments are due 4.5 months after the start of your internship</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SWOT analysis, Report Diary entries.   Criteria ( Reflective exercise to document workplace learning.) Graduate attributes: : A2, A5, D1, D2, E1,F1, F2, F3,F4 As work place has much diversity in terms of learning experiences. It is advised that the above graduate attributes, should be found in an ideal in work environment. It is expected that the report should address the above mentioned graduate attributes. Essential core graduate attributes to be covered in the assessment tasks are: A5, D1, D2, E1, F1.</Data></Cell>
