    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be provided in advance with additional instructions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For students to develop professional client communication skills.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students successfully completing this assessment will, to a satisfactory level, participate in a mock interview.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mock Individual Selection Interview</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 11              Students will be provided in advance with additional instructions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For students to promote themselves effectively to prospective employers.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be provided in advance with additional instructions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students successfully completing this assessment will, to a satisfactory level and via a structured self-reflection report: i. Identify the extent to which they have demonstrated relevant strengths. ii. Identify attributes, knowledge and skills requiring further development.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual Reflection Report’</Data></Cell>
