    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For students to demonstrate career goal-setting aligned to insightful self-reflection.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students successfully completing this assessment will exhibit satisfactory: i. Active participation. ii. Professional conduct</Data></Cell>
