   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43005</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Professional Practice in Australian Context</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">a) Write a Professional Development Plan that analyses your strengths, weaknesses, opportunities and threats (SWOT) in relation to your professional goals, and devises a specific, measurable, achievable, relevant, and timely (SMART) plan for meeting these goals. b) Write a 300 word review of a university workshop or consultation service (e.g. HELPS, Library Workshop, UTS Careers) that meets one of your SMART goals. Evidence of attendance at this service needs to be appended to the Professional Development Plan.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Professional Development Plan</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">600 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">06/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">09:00 AM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9.00am Monday 6 April 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students analyse the communication needed to achieve their professional goals and implement plans to meet those goals.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group work component: Collaborate to write a Workplace Culture Report based on your observations in a workplace that i) describes what you have observed about the workplace culture, and ii) identifies communication practices and collaborations (30%). Individual component: report on the extent to which you have implemented your Professional Development Plan, and how you have revised your communication success plan based on your workplace observations (10%).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Workplace Culture Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group work 800 words; Individual 400 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11/05/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">09:00 AM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9.00am Monday 11 May 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students work collaboratively in a small group to observe professional interactions in a workplace. Based on their observations, students identify what capabilities and attributes they need to successfully participate as an employee in a similar workplace in the future.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students collaboratively simulate the beginning and middle of a scenario observed in their workplace. The audience draws upon their own experiences in various workplaces to suggest ways in which the situation might resolve.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Workplace Communication Simulation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Demonstration</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5-minute simulation followed by 5-10 minutes audience engagement</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week range</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 10 to Week 11              This assessment task is conducted during the tutorial classes in weeks 10 &amp; 11.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Based on their Workplace Culture Report, students identify key communication practices observed in the workplace, and develop their capabilities to engage with these communication practices.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment task is conducted during the tutorial classes in weeks 10 &amp; 11.</Data></Cell>
