    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Each student must develop a project proposal which includes a learning contract and details of the project deliverable with their supervisor. The learning contract of the proposal must be approved by the subject coordinator.</Data></Cell>
