   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32541</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project Management</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Each student will analyze a case study and produce components of a project charter. Full details of this authentic project charter assignment and its associated case study will be available in UTSOnline. It is envisaged that assignment marks and a generic assignment 1 solution will be distributed to students after the mis-session StuVac. This formative feedback is to then be used as a basis for, and be incorporated in, assignment 2.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project Charter</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approximately 1500-2000 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">06:00 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6.00pm Wednesday 15 April 2020              Submit via the Assessment Task 1 page in Canvas</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Submit via the Assessment Task 1 page in Canvas</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assignment is in two (2) parts. Full details of the assignment - Part A - Project Plan and Part B - Personal Reflection will be provided in UTSOnline. Part A - Project Plan (20% - group submission and mark) In groups, students will analyze a case study and produce a project plan. Groups are expected to use and incorporate the feedback obtained from Assignment 1 in their submission of Assignment 2 Part A. Part B - Personal Reflection (10% - individual submission and mark) Each student will write a personal reflection on the group submission of Assignment 2 Part A.  Assignment Return It is envisaged that assignment 2 Part A marks with appropriate feedback will be distributed to students approximately 2 weeks after the assignment submission. Assignment 2 Part B marks will be distributed to students approximately 3 weeks after the assignment submission.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project Plan and Personal Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Part A - Approximately 25 pages Part B - 500 to 600 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due 6pm, Wednesday 3rd June 2020. Submit as follows:   1) Assignment 2 Part A via the Assessment Task 2 - Part A Project Plan page, and   2) Assignment 2 Part B via the Assessment Task 2 – Part B Personal Reflection page</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due 6pm, Wednesday 3rd June 2020. Submit as follows:   1) Assignment 2 Part A via the Assessment Task 2 - Part A Project Plan page, and   2) Assignment 2 Part B via the Assessment Task 2 – Part B Personal Reflection page</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricted open book exam. Students are permitted to take into the exam two A4 pages of double sided notes.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Exam</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam Period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam Period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">On a weekly basis (comencing in week 2) students will workshop various components of a project charter / project plan as set out in the Project Workshops Instructions document which can be found in UTSOnline. Summative feedback from this activity will be provided to students as a guide for the submission of certain components of assessment task 1 and 2.</Data></Cell>
