   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49306</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quality and Operations Management Systems</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This subject has a major group assignment which consists of a number of tasks (parts) which involve various learning activities and sources including researching, literature review, creative and innovative thinking, analytical and problem-solving skills, as well as system thinking and report writing. Assignment requirements including the specific tasks descriptions, examples of marking and Turnitin assessment, date and format of submission, etc. will be made available at the start of each session on the subject website at UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Major group assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Page size requirements are specified in each task (part) of the actual assignment document. Page size difference i.e. slightly under or over is acceptable.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22/05/2020, 11:59pm</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22/05/2020, 11:59pm</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The aim of the practical case is for students to apply the various quality tools and techniques covered in this subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">An open-book final examination will be held at the end of session. It is a formal exam which will be held in the official exam period. Please check the Exams website for date, time and location of your exam. Past exam papers are not available. The quizzes posted at the subject website (UTSOnline) are a good comparison for structure and format of the exam. Most of the quiz questions have been used in the past exams.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
