    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period              Please check the exam-website for date, time and location of your exam.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Please check the exam-website for date, time and location of your exam.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The final exam consists of multiple-choice and true-false questions and open questions. It will test students’ learning progress in terms of both acquired knowledge of subject contents as well as ability to apply concepts and give management recommendations in the context of real-life case scenarios.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be informed of UTSOnline details of Quiz expectations and delivery.</Data></Cell>
