    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quizzes will be given in tutorials and will consist of simple questions to ensure that students can benchmark their understanding of concepts.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Five (5) problem sets will be given throughout the term. Students are allowed to work on these together in small groups but should write up the solutions individually, including a short description of the approach they took and the limitations of that approach.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Problem Sets</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exercises</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3-5 problems, with 100-200 words describing the solution approach for each problem</Data></Cell>
