    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encourage students to engage in the topics more deeply by giving more in-depth and open-ended problems for them to solve.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A list of topics (algorithms/problems) that can apply to a real-world quantum computing scenario will be supplied. Students will work in groups and choose one of the topics to study in further depth. They will prepare an individual report that describes the algorithm, analyses its complexity, and explores and demonstrated its limitations.</Data></Cell>
