   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41009</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Renewable Energy Technology</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students are required to select one favourable renewable energy technology and to write an individual report regarding their findings and insight of a targeted technology. The Guidelines of report are available on UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report about Renewable Energy Technology</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Maximum 5 pages for the report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16 Aug 2019 by 11:59 pm through Turnitin</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16 Aug 2019 by 11:59 pm through Turnitin</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For students to build up their cognitive ability and research skills; to improve report writing skills and to enhance student knowledge and enthusiasm about renewable energy technology</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Closed-book and supervised tests. Covers topics from week 1 and week 4.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">90 minutes + 5 minutes reading time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6 Sep. 2019 (3:25-5:00 pm)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6 Sep. 2019 (3:25-5:00 pm)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To assess students' knowledge of renewable energy technologies (the need, fundamental science and engineering concepts) and energy policy.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be divided into a few groups and are assigned a topic which they need to make a detailed assessment report for some case studies of one targeted renewable energy. The report will include literature review, information analysis and discussion. Students will then present their evaluations in front of other groups and lecturer(s) as well as answer questions raised from the audience.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report and presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group written report (maximum 20 pages for each assignment)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18 Oct. 2019 by 11:59 pm through Turnitin</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To examine all theoretical and operational principles through actual case-studies; to work as a team work; to improve literature review based research and presentation skills. To gain insight into green technology with respect to technical, environmental, economic and social-culture criteria.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18 Oct. 2019 by 11:59 pm through Turnitin</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Open-book exam and all topics covered in the exam.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2 hours + 10 minutes reading time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To assess students' knowledge about renewable energy technologies as well as the assessment of these technologies.</Data></Cell>
