   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32934</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Research Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A research report should be a written report which outlines the motivation behind the topic choice, a literature review and a detailed description of the research undertaken, the methodology used, the results and conclusions, and an outline of future research in the area. The work will be graded on its quality as a piece of independent research and on the quality of the written report. It should be clear that the intellectual effort expended on Research Project (12cp) is more than normally required to pass course work of the same number of credit points. The final report should be submitted to your supervisor and a specific assignment folder for formal assessment.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Research Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 11              by 5pm, Friday 16 October 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">by 5pm, Friday 16 October 2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This task offers students an opportunity to demonstrate their competence in developing a tangible solution for a chosen research problem in ICT related areas.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Oral Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12              The presentation time needs to be organised by the student and agreed by the supervisor and subject coordinator, in Week 12. The video presentation needs to be uploaded by 5pm, Friday 23 October 2020. Please be reminded that this item will be assessed by supervisors and subject coordinator. The oral presentation mark will be the average of the supervisor's mark and the coordinator's mark. In case more than one supervisor assesses the presentation, the supervisor's mark will be the average of marks given by all supervisors.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The presentation time needs to be organised by the student and agreed by the supervisor and subject coordinator, in Week 12. The video presentation needs to be uploaded by 5pm, Friday 23 October 2020. Please be reminded that this item will be assessed by supervisors and subject coordinator. The oral presentation mark will be the average of the supervisor's mark and the coordinator's mark. In case more than one supervisor assesses the presentation, the supervisor's mark will be the average of marks given by all supervisors.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
