   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31138</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Review of IT Experience</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1) SWOT analysis: Please reflect on your final 4 months of work experience to generate the SWOT analysis document. (i.e from the time you finished your first deliverable 31136) Combine and provide a reflection on your 9 months of work experience to identify your SWOT. This should now be an expansion of your earlier SWOT analysis. Write down at least 7 to 8 points under each header. 2) Report: A 4000-word report, the first paragraph should introduce yourself and what your role is in the organisation. The report should detail your work experience since your last submission. Incorporate a summary of your previous work from 31136. 3) A sample page of your learning diary: (You are advised to maintain a diary to keep track of your learning activities). Please provide 6 – 8 entries which you deem as important. Include at least 5-6 new entries since 31136. Please submit your deliverables after you finish 9 months of work experience.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SWOT Report and Diary Entries</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">100</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The whole deliverable should be in a single word file with a word limit of 4000 words.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All assessments are due 9.5 months after the start of your internship.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All assessments are due 9.5 months after the start of your internship.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Expanded SWOT analysis, Report Diary entries.  These 3 deliverables should be submitted as one document. Example 1 Assessment item has 3 sub components. Criteria ( Reflective exercise to document workplace learning.) Graduate attributes: : A2, A5, D1, D2, E1,F1, F2, F3,F4 As work place has much diversity in terms of learning experiences, it is advised that the above graduate attributes, should be found in an ideal in work environment. It is expected that the report should address the above mentioned graduate attributes and build on the experiences gained to the expertise levels. Essential core graduate attributes to be covered in the assessment tasks are: A5, D1, D2, E1, F1.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To build on skills already learnt in 31136 (introductory) to advanced (31138). The graduate attributes remain the same, but the expectations are that deliverables are demonstrated at a higher level of expertise, reflecting 9 months’ work experience.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
