    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The final examination is open book. Each student is allowed to take all notes and textbooks into the examination room. This examination lasts for 2 hours.</Data></Cell>
