   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42044</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Robotics Studio 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Practical tests set out to test the student’s practical knowledge in programming, hardware setup, perception and planning in an incremental manner and provide feedback to students throughout the session. In each practical test, students are provided with a programming code base or hardware that is designed to perform a set task. Students are required to rectify / further develop or configure this code base /hardware to accomplish the set task. Submission of student code for assessment is via an online repository and there is a demonstration in the class. Further information, including guidance on how to obtain the code base/hardware, is available on Canvas.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Practical Tests</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
