   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41081</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sensing, Actuation and Control</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Weekly individual quiz that students partake in before the weekly session. It is used to assess the knowledge the student has gained through using the Zybook online textbook with its excersises.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Knowledge Assessment. (Weekly quiz)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">By the start of your weekly allocated lab class</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">By the start of your weekly allocated lab class</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The assessment task is a companion to the individual work the students do before the weekly session. They give effect to the “flipped” nature of the Subject. It is used to assess the knowledge the student has gained through using the Zybook online textbook with its excersises.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Weekly Quiz as a companion to the Virtual Laboratory. The Quiz is completed using the RIMS system. Questions are aimed at assessing the individual’s engagement with the RIMS exercises as they work through the textbook.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Virtual Laboratory. (Weekly quiz)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In or before your weekly allocated lab class</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In or before your weekly allocated lab class</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The assessment task is a companion to the Virtual Laboratory completed using the RIMS system. The questions are aimed at assessing the individual’s engagement with the RIMS exercises as they companion with the textbook.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Open Book Exam The exam allows students to demonstrate knowledge of embedded systems, design and programming of state machines and tasks, and problem solving which they have learnt in the subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Exam</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Examination</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">UTS Exam period</Data></Cell>
