    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Working program to meet the design criteria. Written Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The aim of this assessment is to learn how to utilize a camera as a sensor in a real world application. The assessment is designed to allow the students to develop a program for a given image processing task.</Data></Cell>
