    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Performance of the software solution. Written Report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The aim of this assessment is for the students to apply appropriate signal processing techniques in providing a solution to a given practical problem. The students will process data through programming and write a report.</Data></Cell>
