    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date Due: by 2 weeks (to the day) after the lab session at</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date Due: by 2 weeks (to the day) after the lab session at</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assignment is intended for students who are attempting to obtain a distinction or high distinction in the subject. With this assignment you can receive an integer value between 0 and 20. The advanced assignment will be made available on UTSOnline. Please ensure that you follow the submission requirements given in the assignment (you can lose marks if these requirements are not followed). Please note that marks awarded for the advanced assignment have no affect as to whether you pass the subject or not.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advanced Assignment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
