    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To test understanding of the topics in the subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Solve problems related to (1) network dynamics, and (2) information network and world wide web.</Data></Cell>
