    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This assessment task will require a team of 2-4 students to analyze the network data of their interest. This involves identifying, collecting, visualizing and analyzing network data arising from real life. The additional information about the project report structure and detailed marking scheme will be provided in the assignment brief. Brief will be made available via UTSOnline.</Data></Cell>
