   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41114</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Software Development Studio 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The task for students is to demonstrate communication and collaboration skills as assessed by there peers via SparkPLUS , the ability to give feedback to other team members via SparkPLUS and to reflect on teamwork over the semester, notably how they think they have improved their communication and collaboration with examples, written in their journal. Note: There is a separate Assignment document (available at the beginning of each semester) which gives fuller details for each assessment task.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Teamwork assessment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date/Time</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">08/11/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11:55 PM</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11.55pm Sunday 8 November 2020              NB there are 3 different deliverables for  Assessment Task 1; the first deliverable is optional:      • 1. SparkPLUS teamwork, formative evaluation - opens Mon 7th September 2020 (due Sun 13th September 2020, 11:55pm);  • 2. SparkPLUS teamwork, final evaluation - opens Mon 2nd November 2020 (due Sun 8th November 2020, 11:55pm);  and  • 3. Overall reflection on teamwork - submit as final entry in reflection journal on Confluence  (due Sun 8th November 2020, 11:55pm).See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">NB there are 3 different deliverables for  Assessment Task 1; the first deliverable is optional:      • 1. SparkPLUS teamwork, formative evaluation - opens Mon 7th September 2020 (due Sun 13th September 2020, 11:55pm);  • 2. SparkPLUS teamwork, final evaluation - opens Mon 2nd November 2020 (due Sun 8th November 2020, 11:55pm);  and  • 3. Overall reflection on teamwork - submit as final entry in reflection journal on Confluence  (due Sun 8th November 2020, 11:55pm).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purpose of this task is for students to understand how well they are operating in a team.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The task for students is: to demonstrate critical reflection expressed as high level competence in their personal reflection journal, and, to demonstrate building design reflection capability in their weekly design reflection journals.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflective ability assessment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
