    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 3 to Week 13              There are 3 different due dates for the 3 deliverables for this assessment: Learning Contract for Process Critique report (individual), due Sun 23rd August 2020, 11:55pm (submit on UTSonline); Process Critique report (individual), due Sun 4th October 2020, 11:55 pm  (submit on UTSonline); and Process assessment (team), due Wed 11th November 2020, 11:55pm.   Submission for the latter is the collection of the team's weekly project management and process entries in the online Jira and Confluence tools.See also Further information.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purpose of this task is to learn to make and record process decisions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There are 3 different due dates for the 3 deliverables for this assessment: Learning Contract for Process Critique report (individual), due Sun 23rd August 2020, 11:55pm (submit on UTSonline); Process Critique report (individual), due Sun 4th October 2020, 11:55 pm  (submit on UTSonline); and Process assessment (team), due Wed 11th November 2020, 11:55pm.   Submission for the latter is the collection of the team's weekly project management and process entries in the online Jira and Confluence tools.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The task for students is to demonstrate that the client is satisfied, the outcomes specified for the project description have been achieved, and the product operates without failing.  Note: There is a separate Assignment document (available at the beginning of each semester) which gives fuller details for each assessment task.</Data></Cell>
