    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Software Engineering Studio 1A</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Prepare appropriate project plan that will enable you to effectively manage work in the group. Provide a formal report of the team’s analysis of their technology stack requirements, proposed solution and its rationale. Propose appropriate methodology to solve the proposed problem</Data></Cell>
