    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Software development teams are expected to learn self-management skill and that includes monitoring and documenting individual and peer contribution. Prepare Sprint Retrospectives: a. provide clear individual progress in every single sprint b. analyse your performance and problems in every single sprint c. provide potential solutions to coming sprint.</Data></Cell>
