    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Slide due 11:59 pm 11/09/20 and presentation in class</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Slide due 11:59 pm 11/09/20 and presentation in class</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purpose of this task is for students to address the project scope, achievement, timeline and team member’s role according to the proposed project.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The tasks for students are to demonstrate:  critical individual reflection via weekly journal, high-level systematic software engineering synthesis in design thinking process,  individual contributions and members’ inputs during decision making</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflective ability and design thinking</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Journal</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1000 - 3000 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assessment 2-1 Due 11:59pm 11/09/2020; Assessment 2-2 Due 11:59pm 23/10/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assessment 2-1 Due 11:59pm 11/09/2020; Assessment 2-2 Due 11:59pm 23/10/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The purpose of this task is to evaluate how well students are learning to 1. reflect their work, 2. design system/software, 3. make proper decisions.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The task for students is to demonstrate:  efficient communication, closed collaboration and high engagement in the team, reflection of the teamwork by clear and detail record of stand-up and/or retrospective meeting, ability to have exhaustive record for meeting procedure and decisions, ability to give proper rates and feedback to team members via SPARKPlus.</Data></Cell>
