   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48366</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Steel and Timber Design</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Online Quiz identifies relevant aspects of steel and timber material properties and behaviour that are reflected in code requirements for design.The quiz includes steel design and timber design components which each component worth 50% of the overal mark, respectively.</Data></Cell>
