    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To allow students to demonstrate what they have learnt, to establish what more they should learn and give them the opportunity to have formative and feed forward assessment of their performance.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All assignments are quantitative – design calculations and subsequent design decisions will be required to complete the assignments. Timber Assignment 01: Timber tension member design, submitted individually online as a spreadsheet. Timber Assignment 02: Timber compression member design, submitted individually online as a spreadsheet. Timber Assignment 03: Timber beam member design, submitted individually online as a spreadsheet. Timber Assignment 04: Timber connection design, submitted individually online as a spreadsheet.</Data></Cell>
