    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Timber Assignment 01 : Due date 31th of March at 5 pm; Timber Assignment 02 : Due date 14th of April at 5 pm; Timber Assignment 03 : Due date 5th of May at 5 pm; and Timber Assignment 04 : Due date 26th of May at 5 pm.</Data></Cell>
