    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To gain experience in structural design on the given separate topics. All assignments are quantitative – design calculations and subsequent design decisions will be required to complete the assignments.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The In-class quiz has two separate components. Steel design component worth 60% and Timber design component worth 40% of the overall mark. The in-class quiz consists of calculations as well as true or false questions.</Data></Cell>
