    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Storytelling and Sense-making Studio</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">E-tivities are a series of online activities which take place in UTSOnline. In addition to the topics covered in class, there will be parallel online discussion and activities in UTSOnline around specific issues and questions related to the subject and assessment tasks. You should utilise the online discussion to:  collaborate and share information with other students seek answers to anything you feel you do not fully understand about the subject, topics, or assessment tasks continue debating issues raised in class avoid feeling lost or isolated when working by yourself on your assessment tasks.</Data></Cell>
