    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">RATINGS: -1 for someone who was a hindrance to the team in this criteria 0 no contribution 1 less than average for the team 2 average for the team 3 above average for the team 4 well above average for the team Your overall score will be used to calculate (applied to 50%) your individual grade from your group mark for the Group project plan and proposal (Task 3)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Self and Peer Assessment promotes equitable participation in group tasks, a well-known assessment trouble spot. By helping students recognise their choices about how they participate in groups Self &amp; Peer Assessment be very effective in promoting more equitable and thoughtful participation in group tasks. This development of students’ understanding of the group work process can improve the experience of group work for students and contributes directly to the development of teamwork skills.</Data></Cell>
