   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31280</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Strategic IT Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will be assessed on the individual's ongoing student contribution to the team effort and the professional / industry-like manner in which the student works during the session – both during tutorials and group meetings. The assessment will include conduct and contribution at meetings, meeting of deadlines, and provision of working materials and documentation, including adgendas, minutes, etc, as required by the tutor.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tutorial Mark (Individual)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Laboratory/practical</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
