   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32005</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Strategic Leadership for Innovation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You will be required to identify and analyse key attributes of a current, or recent past, IT project in your business that requires real changes within the business for the project to meet its objectives, and to identify the organisational, cultural and human factors that are key to the project's outcomes . Provide a concise overview of the IT project, with context and relevance to the organisation, as a whole, clearly articulated and logically explained; State the most important critical success factors (CSFs) that you see as relevant and/or important; then provide a concise rationale as to why each factor is important. Nominate the key stakeholders in the project. Then identify and analyse the managerial and leadership influences that each of the key stakeholders has on the IT project. Explain how these influences help or hinder the achievement of the desired outcome(s) of the IT project; Explain how these influences help or hinder the achievement of the desired outcome(s) of the project; State the key elements of innovation, and analyse how these contribute to the desired outcome(s) of the IT project.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study part 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Minimum length is 2,500 words; maximum length is 3,000 words (excluding references).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Date</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27/08/2018</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Monday 27 August 2018              Soft copy to be handed in at 6:00 pm on Monday 27th August 2018</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Soft copy to be handed in at 6:00 pm on Monday 27th August 2018</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To systematically analyse and critique the opportunities to drive strategic business value and facilitate innovation using new technologies and to learn how different management perspectives may impact the realisation of these opportunities in practice.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Through stakeholder interviews, the perspectives of leadership and their influence on project outcomes are analysed. Findings are correlated with the CSFs identified in the first assessment task and conclusions drawn on the various leadership factors that influence project outcomes . Provide a concise overview of the technological, leadership, organisational, cultural and human factors that are (were, or will be) key to the project's outcomes; Describe the rationale for the selection of the key stakeholders that were interviewed; Describe your stakeholder interview methodology, and overall approach to information gathering and subsequent analysis; Analyse the effectiveness of each interview; Correlate the interview findings with the CSFs identified in Case Study Part 1, using an appropriately structured methodology, and comment on the importance and relevance of the various factors of leadership to the outcomes of the project.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study part 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Case study</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Minimum length is 2,500 words; maximum length is 3,000 words (excluding references).</Data></Cell>
