   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49134</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Structural Dynamics and Earthquake Engineering</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1. two online quizzes (each online quiz has two parts. The 2nd part can be unlocked after satisfactory completion of the 1st part.) 2. two assignments</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Online Quizzes and Assignments - Assessing learning performance through entire session</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exercises</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Various</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To be published on UTSOnline</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To be published on UTSOnline</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The online quizzes and assignments assess learning performance through the entire session.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The project has two main components: 1) laboratory testing and data analysis; 2) design and verification. The results need to be disseminated by a report and a presentation.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Project</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">through the enire session.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To be published on UTSOnline</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To be published on UTSOnline</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The group project is designed to provide students with an opportunity to develop an essential skill of an engineer, i.e. working with a group to solve an engineering problem by applying learnt (or new) knowledge. It encourages group learning, group management, group discussion, deeper learning, innovation and engineering ethics. The project runs through the entire session. The outcomes of the learning will be assessed by the group project report, individual learning reflection and presentations at the end of the session.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Part A (open book) Part B (open book)</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiz/test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2 hours (approximately)</Data></Cell>
