    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assess the threshold knowledge needed for students to complete this subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To be published on UTSOnline</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final Exam (30%) has two parts: Part 1 -10%(open book, 10 questions, 40 minutes) and Part 2 -20%(open book, 5 questions, 110 minutes).</Data></Cell>
