    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12, with virtual pre-submissions via Github + feedback on submitted draft in weeks 7 and 10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12, with virtual pre-submissions via Github + feedback on submitted draft in weeks 7 and 10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Group, group and individually assessed</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Document research project in a concise, effective, and professional manner.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students make weekly contributions to their portfolio, demonstrating the development of their thinking in this area and their engagement with the issues discussed in class. Students develop their learning in the area of complex systems and demonstrate this through evidence of inquiry and reflection. Through peer communication and reflection students synthesize their learning throughout the session to build a holistic picture of the subject matter.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflective portfolio</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
