    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12, with virtual pre-submissions via Github + feedback on weeks 7 and 10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Week 12, with virtual pre-submissions via Github + feedback on weeks 7 and 10</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To demonstrate evidence of enquiry and reflection on many model thinking.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This is evidenced by the contribution by the student, and by their provision of, constructive feedback on peer work via Canvas and Github. Exercises, topics and situations will be posed for students to comment on and debate. 5 sets of discussion/debates will be spread throughout the session.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Engagement in online discussions and peer feedback</Data></Cell>
