    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Levelling exercise submit before Tutorial in week 4 (3 marks plus 1 Two Peg Test) Angle Reading is marked on attendance at session (1 mark each) Traversing Exercise – submit report prior to Practical Exercise in week 7 (4 marks) Vertical Curve Exercise – submit  report prior to practical exercise week 9 (4 Marks) Stadia Exercise - submit prior to practical exercise in Week 11 (3 marks) Horizontal Curve Set Out – marked on site, on the on day of Practical Work (4 Marks)</Data></Cell>
