    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Students will use exploratory testing (a standard Agile test process) to seek to understand a system, not just bugs but operational and functional capabilities. Assessment documents must be submitted using Turnitin.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exploratory Test</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
