    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Please note: Assessment criteria weighting is approximate - for detailed criteria please see assessment guide, attached.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To establish search skills and the ability to evaluate the appropriateness of the articles chosen. To develop the skills of critical analysis and synthesis, direct and indirect citation, referencing and the writing of a complete report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Give a presentation based on key aspects of Assessment 4 (Project Proposal or Literature Review).</Data></Cell>
