    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Preparation for class sessions and performance (P&amp;P) during class exercises will be assessed. Feedback on the exercises and tasks will be provided throughout the semester to help students evaluate their learning and progress. The assessed items are: In-class exercises (7 marks): are identified by an (*) in the Subject Outline under the NOTES section for each week. Some of these exercises require preparation before the class session - any preparation is also explained in the NOTES section. Turnitin Tasks (3 marks): One of the preparation tasks must be submitted via Turnitin for three marks in total (these are also noted with (*) in the weekly program). Quizzes (5 marks): The preparation marks also include quizzes at the beginning of some classes to assess reading and core topics material, and preparation for classes.</Data></Cell>
