   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49215</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Telecommunications Industry Management</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The subject is divided into blocks of 3 weeks (except for topic 2 which has only 2 weeks):  week 1 of each block is a workshop class to develop ideas and introduce and discuss key concepts week 2 has no formal class but allows students to explore materials provided online and test understanding with sample questions (incorporated into week 1 for topic 2) week 3 involves the following  tutorial - Q&amp;A Individual review quiz - to test understanding and give feedback on progress    The quiz will be an online quiz completed in a computer lab with a duration between 40 and 50 minutes.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Review Quizzes</Data></Cell>
