    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">This project will be completed individually with students consulting with others as needed to master the content and hone their delivery of the information. You will be informed in the first tutorial session of the task required and due date. Additional credit may be awarded for project work that exceeds the requirements of the criteria set out below.</Data></Cell>
