    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To demonstrate knowledge and competence with the subject.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Final-exam date will be during the University's exam period.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Two lab experiments, each on a different type of turbomachines.</Data></Cell>
