   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49107</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Urban Stormwater Design</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Undertake a design of roof and property drainage compliant with Australian Standards. Task involves spreadsheet calculation and producing design sketches.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">As a guide your assignment should be approximately 10 pages long including any diagrams. The entire assignment must be submitted as a single report in Word or PDF format.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Apply theoretical concepts and design methods to a practical situation with respect to Property Drainage and OSD</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Undertake a design of street drainage system according to Australian Best Practice Guides Standards. Task involves system modelling using DRAINS software, spreadsheet calculation and producing design sketches.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">As a guide your assignment should be approximately 10 pages long including any diagrams. The entire assignment must be submitted as a single report in Word or PDF format.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18/04/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Apply theoretical concepts and design methods to a practical situation with respect to Street Drainage.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Undertake a hydraulic/ flood study of a portion of an urban catchment that is prone to flooding. Task involves system modelling using HEC-RAS software, and producing flood study report.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Assignment 3</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">As a guide your assignment should be approximately 10 pages long including any diagrams. The entire assignment must be submitted as a single report in Word or PDF format.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23/05/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Apply theoretical concepts and design methods to practical situation with respect to 1) 2D Modelling or 2) modelling bridges or other hydraulic structures (fence/gate).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23/05/2020</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To devise and assess the effectiveness of a stormwater quality treatment train and how well it meets Australian Best Practice. Task involves system modelling using MUSIC software and presenting results in a summary report.</Data></Cell>
