    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due dates for assessment tasks in this module are determined by your internship start date. There is an Excel spreadsheet for downloading in the module on UTSOnline that will calculate your due dates.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due dates for assessment tasks in this module are determined by your internship start date. There is an Excel spreadsheet for downloading in the module on UTSOnline that will calculate your due dates.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Full Title: Understanding and developing professional and personal competencies required for professional practice During this module, students will record how they have been developing competencies required for professional practice in a personal ePortfolio. This ePortfolio will serve as a record of achievement as well as evidence of having met various levels of UTS:FEIT Graduate Attributes and/or Engineers Australia stage 1 and/or stage 2 competencies. The ePortfolio can become a powerful tool in securing future employment and/or an application for chartered status.</Data></Cell>
