   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41071</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Work Integrated Learning 1</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this task students will document their internship experience through both reflection and the collection of artefacts (where allowed by their employer) such as photos, and screenshots of work. Every week students should document a specific learning experience in their journal. Students will submit their first four entries in week 4 (task 1a) for feedback. Entries for weeks 5-16 are developed throughout the semester and submitted in Week 16 (1b). The final entry should be a longer entry looking back at the student’s internship as a whole. Each normal entry should be 250 words, the final entry should be 500 words. In total students should submit at least 10 entries over the 16 weeks.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflective Portfolio</Data></Cell>
