    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Designed to broaden students' learning from their internship beyond their immediate roles and demonstrating professional behaviours in the workplace focusing on lifelong learning.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this task students consider their current attainment level of the FEIT Graduate Attributes. Students will assess their strengths and weaknesses in these attributes as well as opportunities to improve their skills in these areas. This task is a formative task towards Assessment Task 4 and is the first step in determining competency in the attributes which will be demonstrated in Assessment Task 4. This task may also assist students in completing their learning plan from the co-requisite subject 41072.</Data></Cell>
