    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop student ability to reflect on their abilities and institute a plan for professional development.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this assessment students will complete a self-assessment of their internship performance and participate in a performance review with their supervisor. Once both assessments are completed the student will write a reflection on the assessment process, the results, and future actions they will take in light of their self-assessment and supervisor feedback.</Data></Cell>
