    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this report students will develop competency claims for the FEIT Graduate Attributes. Students should consider what it means to be competent in these attributes and how they have demonstrated their competency in the workplace. Demonstration of a competency should include a critical incident or concrete example of a time they demonstrated the attribute in question.</Data></Cell>
