   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41072</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Work Integrated Learning 2</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this task students will assess their knowledge and skills and identify areas of potential improvement. Students should take into consideration their supervisor(s) and mentor(s) advice, internship requirements and context, and professional goals when evaluating their areas of potential improvement. Once students have evaluated their knowledge and skills and identified areas for improvement they will develop a learning plan for the semester to improve their knowledge and skills in these areas. Plans should be feasible considering the time frame and the student’s ability to access required materials as well as relevant to their internship or professional goals.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Learning Plan</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">750 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 4</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 4</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop a plan for professional development within the IT discipline.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this task students will produce a video on an IT issue or topic of their choice. The video should either be pitched to an IT professional who might not work in your particular area of IT or to the general public. The video should teach the chosen audience about the IT topic and should be pitched at an appropriate level of technical detail for the chosen audience. The video should demonstrate your ability to communicate IT issues or topics.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Communicate an IT Topic</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Presentation</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3-5 minute video</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 11</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 11</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To demonstrate learning progress and develop communication skills through the communication of an IT topic.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this task students will reflect on their learning from the semester. Each item on the learning plan should be addressed as well as any deviations from the plan. In the reflection students should discuss what they learned, include artifacts or evidence of completion and discuss any key take-aways and next-steps.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Learning Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2000 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 16</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop reflective learning skills and to demonstrate progress on the learning plan.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 16</Data></Cell>
