   <Row>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41073</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Work Integrated Learning 3</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this task students will document their internship experience through both reflection and the collection of artefacts (where allowed by their employer) such as photos, and screenshots of work. Every week students should document a specific learning experience in their journal. Students will submit their first four entries in week 4 (task 1a) for feedback. Entries for weeks 5-16 are developed throughout the semester and submitted in Week 16 (1b). Entry 16 should be a longer entry looking back at students' internship as a whole.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflective Portfolio</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2500 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1a: Sunday 11:59pm Week 4, 1b: Sunday 11:59pm Week 16</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1a: Sunday 11:59pm Week 4, 1b: Sunday 11:59pm Week 16</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Designed to broaden students' learning from their internship beyond their immediate roles and demonstrating professional behaviours in the workplace focusing on lifelong learning.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this task students consider their current attainment level of the Skills for the Information Age. Students will assess their strengths and weaknesses in these skills as well as opportunities to improve their skills in these areas. This task is a formative task towards task 4 and is the first step in determining competency in the skills which will be demonstrated in task 4. This task may also assist students in completing their learning plan from the sister subject 41074.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SWOT analysis of Skills for the Information Age attainment</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">750 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 3</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 3</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop student ability to reflect on their abilities and institute a plan for professional development.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this assessment students will complete a self-assessment of their internship performance and participate in a performance review with their supervisor. Once both assessments are completed the student will write a reflection on the assessment process, the results and future actions they will take to action any feedback they have received or identified for themselves. All three components should then be submitted.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Self and supervisor performance</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Portfolio</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">250-word reflection</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 7</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop student ability to seek and receive feedback, self-assessment skills and ability to reflect on feedback in order to develop plans for future development.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 7</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In this report students will develop competency claims for the Skills for the Information Age. Students should consider what it means to be competent in these skills and how they have demonstrated their competency in the workplace. Competency claims should include a critical incident or concrete example of a time they demonstrated the skill in question.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Skills for the Information Age Claims Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Report</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2000 words</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Custom</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 13</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sunday 11:59pm Week 13</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Individual</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To develop student ability to reflect on their abilities and demonstrate them to employers.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Provide a reflection on a Leadership (or Followership) issue as experience in their workplace and if necessary expand into a report about Leadership styles in general (introduction); what they have learnt (Stage 2 Kolb), where this approach could be reapplied (Stage 3 Kolb) how they will engage in leadership in the future (Stage 4 Kolb).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due between Week 2 to Week 8.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due between Week 2 to Week 8.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Designed to broaden students' learning from their internship beyond their immediate roles and demonstrating professional behaviours in the workplace focusing on leadership issues.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Provide a reflection on a Diversity issue as experience in their workplace and if necessary expand into a report about SDiversity in general (introduction); what they have learnt (Stage 2 Kolb), where this approach could be reapplied (Stage 3 Kolb) how they will harness diversity in the future (Stage 4 Kolb).</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due between Week 2 to Week 8.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Due between Week 2 to Week 8.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Designed to broaden students' learning from their internship beyond their immediate roles and demonstrating professional behaviours in the workplace focusing on harnessing culture and diversity.</Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
    <Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell>
